Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:11.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}片名 神鬼奇航 鬼盗船魔咒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.63,0:00:45.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yo ho Yo ho
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.71,0:00:48.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海盗生涯乐逍\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A pirate's life for me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.80,0:00:54.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们强豪夺 作奸犯科……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We extort, we pilfer We filch, we sack
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.64,0:00:56.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别唱了 小姑娘\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Drink...   -Quiet, missy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.22,0:00:58.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这儿有海盗船出没\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cursed pirates sail these waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.64,0:01:00.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想惹褐上身？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't want to bring them down on us, do ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.98,0:01:02.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吉 卜先生 别唬她\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Gibbs, that will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.60,0:01:05.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她在唱海盗歌儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She was singing about pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.52,0:01:07.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这会招来厄运的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bad luck to be singing about pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.73,0:01:10.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尤其是起这大的浓雾 你要我的话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with us mired in this unnatural fog, mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.99,0:01:12.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我到了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Consider them marked.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.07,0:01:16.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你去忙吧 是，」上尉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-On your way.   -Aye, Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.58,0:01:18.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}带女人上船一定会倒媚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bad luck to have a woman on board, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.70,0:01:20.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就算是个小姑娘\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Even a miniature one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:24.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得能见到海盗一定很棒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think it'd be rather exciting to meet a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.25,0:01:28.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那可不见得 史小姐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Think again, Miss Swann.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.42,0:01:31.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海盗都是龈的蛋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Vile and dissolute creatures, the lot of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.34,0:01:34.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要看到海盗船或是臭海盗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I intend to see to it that any man who sails under a pirate flag
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.51,0:01:37.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就会他们到苦头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or wears a pirate brand gets what he deserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.35,0:01:40.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用子把他们吊死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A short drop and a sudden stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.56,0:01:47.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}倪上尉 你的勇气可嘉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lieutenant Norrington, I appreciate your fervor,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.23,0:01:51.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是这种话题会教我女儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I'm concerned about the effect this subject will have upon my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.94,0:01:53.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很抱歉 史总督\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My apologies, Governor Swann.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.82,0:01:56.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得海盗很好玩耶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually, I find it all fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.12,0:01:57.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是携心这点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. That's what concerns me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.15,0:02:27.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们看\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look! A boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.23,0:02:28.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海里有一个小男孩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's a boy in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.03,0:02:32.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人落海了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Man overboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.24,0:02:35.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快去拿勾\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Man the ropes! Fetch a hook!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.78,0:02:38.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快把他拖上船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Haul him aboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.67,0:02:48.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他还有气\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's still breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.67,0:02:50.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老天\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mary, Mother of God!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.47,0:02:58.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是怎回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.43,0:03:04.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大概是火药桶爆炸 商船通常都有强大火力\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Most likely the powder magazine. Merchant vessels run heavily armed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:07.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}火力再强大也没有用\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lot of good it did them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.90,0:03:10.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家都心知肚明\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everyone's thinking it, I'm just saying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.44,0:03:12.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是海盗干的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.61,0:03:15.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别鼠讲\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's no proof of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.49,0:03:17.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这只是意外\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was probably an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.74,0:03:20.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把船长叫醒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rouse the captain immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.45,0:03:22.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收帆\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Aye, sir.   -Heave to and take in sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.45,0:03:24.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}派出长艇\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Lower the boats.   -Heave to!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.29,0:03:28.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊莉莎白 去陪那小男孩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Elizabeth, I want you to accompany the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.79,0:03:32.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要你负责照顾他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He'll be in your charge. Take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.15,0:03:53.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.94,0:03:56.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我叫伊莉莎白史旺\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My name's Elizabeth Swann.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.99,0:03:59.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}威尔杜纳\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will Turner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.41,0:04:02.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会照顾你的 威尔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm watching over you, WiII.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.13,0:04:16.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是个海盗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.30,0:04:19.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他了什没有？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Has he said anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.18,0:04:22.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他只他叫威廉杜纳\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His name's William Turner. That's all I found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.39,0:04:24.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把他带下去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take him below.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.96,0:05:36.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊莉莎白 ？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Elizabeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.59,0:05:39.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.17,0:05:42.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你穿好衣服了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you decent?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.93,0:05:44.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}穿好了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.47,0:05:47.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这时候你还在睡？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Still in bed at this hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.98,0:05:51.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外面天气很好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a beautiful day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.77,0:05:55.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要送你一份礼物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have a gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.32,0:06:01.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好美哦 是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, it's beautiful!   -Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.95,0:06:04.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天是什特别日子？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}May I inquire as to the occasion?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.95,0:06:08.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}做爸爸的不能送女儿礼物？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Does a father need an occasion to dote upon his daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.95,0:06:11.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.46,0:06:15.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.63,0:06:20.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我希望你穿去参加典礼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I had hoped you might wear it for the ceremony today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.30,0:06:21.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}典礼？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ceremony?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.63,0:06:24.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}倪上校的升职典礼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Captain Norrington's promotion ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.13,0:06:25.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.38,0:06:28.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他马上就是倪准将了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Commodore Norrington, as he's about to become.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.76,0:06:30.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一位标的绅士 ，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A fine gentleman, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.47,0:06:32.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他喜欢你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He fancies you, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.98,0:06:35.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊莉莎白 ？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Elizabeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.14,0:06:36.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How's it coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.90,0:06:38.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不上来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's difficult to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.69,0:06:41.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是伦敦最新的时装\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm told it's the latest fashion in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.90,0:06:43.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伦敦的女人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, women in London
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.32,0:06:44.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一定都不必呼吸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}must've learned not to breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.16,0:06:48.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大人 您有访客\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My Lord, you have a visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.14,0:07:08.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杜先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Turner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.39,0:07:09.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很高兴见到你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.93,0:07:11.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}您好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good day, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.68,0:07:13.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}您订的宝剑做好了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have your order.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.36,0:07:20.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.61,0:07:22.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}剑身精钢打造\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The blade is folded steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.44,0:07:25.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}剑柄镶金逸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's gold filigree laid into the handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.15,0:07:27.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I may?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.57,0:07:31.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}完美的平衡感\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Perfectly balanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.83,0:07:34.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}剑根和剑身乎一样宽\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The tang is nearly the full width of the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.04,0:07:39.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}佩服\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Impressive. Very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.25,0:07:40.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.25,0:07:44.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}倪准将一定会很满意\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Commodore Norrington's going to be very pleased with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.38,0:07:47.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请代我向你的师傅致谢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do pass my compliments onto your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.05,0:07:51.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I shall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.51,0:07:55.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}剑师到都会很高兴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A craftsman is always pleased to hear his work is appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.35,0:08:00.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊莉莎白 你真是艳光四射\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Elizabeth! You look absolutely stunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.90,0:08:01.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}威尔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.07,0:08:04.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}见到你真好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's So good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.99,0:08:07.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我昨晚梦到了你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I had a dream about you last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.74,0:08:08.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}梦到了我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}About me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.90,0:08:10.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这恰当？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is it entirely proper for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.57,0:08:12.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们识的那天 记得？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}About the day we met. Do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.45,0:08:15.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我怎能忘记 史小姐？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How could I forget, Miss Swann?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.29,0:08:17.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我过多少次 叫我伊莉莎白\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How many times must I ask you to call me Elizabeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.91,0:08:22.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少得再一次 史小姐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At least once more, Miss Swann. As always.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.13,0:08:23.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瞧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.46,0:08:25.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这小子懂得分寸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At least the boy has a sense of propriety.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.84,0:08:27.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得走了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We really must be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.13,0:08:28.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.47,0:08:30.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见 杜先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good day, Mr. Turner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.34,0:08:33.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come along!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.72,0:08:37.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good day...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.77,0:08:42.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊莉莎白\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.83,0:09:37.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海盗没好下场
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.03,0:10:14.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你给我等一下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold up there, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.32,0:10:19.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请付泊船费一先令\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a shilling to tie up your boat to the dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.66,0:10:23.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还要报上名来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I shall need to know your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.04,0:10:28.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不如给你三先令\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you say to three shillings,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.38,0:10:29.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就别这麻了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and we forget the name?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.09,0:10:35.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎临皇家港 史密斯先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome to Port Royal, Mr. Smith.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.75,0:11:13.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}向前走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Two paces... march!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.13,0:11:18.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}向后转\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right about... face!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.68,0:11:23.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}睾枪致敬\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Present... arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.71,0:11:50.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老百姓不准上码头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This dock is off limits to civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.54,0:11:52.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}歹势，手 我不知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm terribly sorry, I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.34,0:11:55.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看到老百姓一定会告你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I see one, I shall inform you immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.64,0:12:02.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}城堡在行盛大典礼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Apparently, there's some high-toned and fancy to-do up at the fort, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.30,0:12:05.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们雨位绅士\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How could it be two upstanding gentlemen, such as yourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.56,0:12:07.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎没受到邀请呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}did not merit an invitation?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.60,0:12:10.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要保护船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Someone has to make sure this dock stays off limit to civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.81,0:12:13.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是令人钦佩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a fine goal, to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.27,0:12:15.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But it seems to me, a...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.32,0:12:17.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟这艘大船比起来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...a Ship like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.15,0:12:20.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这艘小船就不看\N{\rEN\blur0.8}makes this one here a bit superfluous, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.20,0:12:23.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}无畏号的确是威力无法擂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, the Dauntless is the power in these waters, true enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.37,0:12:27.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是没有一艘船 比截者号更快\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but there's no ship that can match the lnterceptor for speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.37,0:12:28.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有一艘比它快\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've heard of one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.50,0:12:31.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一艘都追不上的快船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's supposed to be very fast, nigh uncatchable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.25,0:12:33.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鬼盗船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Black Pear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.55,0:12:38.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有真正的船比截者号快\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's no real ship that can match the lnterceptor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.47,0:12:42.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鬼盗船是艘真正的船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Black Pearl is a real ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.55,0:12:44.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}才不是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.22,0:12:45.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是 我见过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, it is. I've seen it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.31,0:12:47.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你见过？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've seen it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.48,0:12:48.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.56,0:12:50.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你才没见过咧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You haven't seen it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.56,0:12:51.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, I have!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.69,0:12:53.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你见过一艘船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've seen a ship
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.19,0:12:55.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}扬著黑帆\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with black sails,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.28,0:12:56.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船员受到咒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that's crewed by the damned,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.03,0:12:59.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它的船长邪恶到……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and captained by a man so evil
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.57,0:13:02.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}连地都容不下他？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that hell itself spat him back out?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.99,0:13:05.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有 当然没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.99,0:13:08.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过我见过 一艘扬著黑帆的船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I have seen a ship with black sails.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.20,0:13:11.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要是扬著黑帆的船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And no ship that's not crewed by the damned,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.46,0:13:14.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船员就会受到咒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and captained by a man so evil that hell spat him back out
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.38,0:13:16.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船长就邪恶到……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}could possibly have black sails,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.09,0:13:18.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}连地都容不下他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}therefore couldn't possibly be any other ship
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.30,0:13:21.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就一定是鬼盗船 是这样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}than the Black Pearl, is that what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.76,0:13:22.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.93,0:13:24.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就嘛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.30,0:13:27.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没真正的船比得上截者号\N{\rEN\blur0.8}there's no real ship that can match the Interceptor...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.98,0:13:30.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.44,0:13:33.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.56,0:13:35.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我下来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get away from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.69,0:13:38.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能上去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't have permission to be aboard there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.11,0:13:39.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}歹势，这艘船太酷了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry. It's such a pretty boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.90,0:13:40.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.65,0:13:42.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你叫什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.74,0:13:43.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}史密斯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Smith!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.78,0:13:45.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}叫我小史也行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or Smithy, if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.58,0:13:48.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你来皇家港有何贵斡 史密斯先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's your purpose in Port Royal, Mr. Smith?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.91,0:13:49.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不准\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, and no lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.00,0:13:51.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.54,0:13:52.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我只好实话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I confess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.96,0:13:56.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是来偷一艘船 找一批船员\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is my intention to commandeer one of these ships, pick up a crew
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.34,0:13:59.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后烧杀掳掠 大特\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in Tortuga to rape, pillage, and pilfer my weasely black guts out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.80,0:14:01.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不准\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I said, no lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.76,0:14:03.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看他是在实话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think he's telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.76,0:14:05.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果他是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If he were telling the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.39,0:14:06.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就不会出来啦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}he wouldn't have told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.60,0:14:11.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非我早就料到 你们一定不会信\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unless he knew you wouldn't believe the truth, even if he told it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.86,0:14:23.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有空？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}May I have a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.20,0:14:33.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好美 伊莉莎白\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You look lovely, Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:35.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.88,0:14:39.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请原我的冒昧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I apologize if I seem forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.63,0:14:41.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是我必须直话直\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I must speak my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.59,0:14:47.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我这次的升职我想到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This promotion throws into sharp relief
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.64,0:14:50.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}另一个未了的心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that which I have not yet achieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.06,0:14:54.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是想娶一位 完美的女人为妻\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A marriage to a fine woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.35,0:14:59.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而你是我想娶的完美女人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have become a fine woman, Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.61,0:15:00.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能呼吸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.07,0:15:04.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也紧张得不能呼吸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, l... I'm a bit nervous myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.32,0:15:09.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们推我当首领\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then they made me their chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.99,0:15:13.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊莉莎白 ？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Elizabeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.75,0:15:16.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊莉莎白 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Elizabeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.00,0:15:21.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她没撞到岩石真是个奇\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The rocks! Sir, it's a miracle she missed them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.22,0:15:26.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们不去救她？ 我不会游泳\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Will you be saving her, then?   -I can't swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.68,0:15:30.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们真是丢丢到家了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pearl of the King's Navy, you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.72,0:15:32.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别搞丢了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do not lose these!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.90,0:15:48.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.95,0:16:31.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我扶住她了 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.33,0:16:34.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她没气了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's not breathing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.58,0:16:35.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.67,0:16:44.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没想到这招\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I never would've thought of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:46.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是因为你没见过世面\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Clearly you've never been to Singapore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.34,0:16:53.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是哪儿弄来的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.18,0:16:57.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}站起来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.77,0:17:01.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊莉莎白 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Elizabeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.36,0:17:04.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事吧？ 没事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Are you all right?   -Yes, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.32,0:17:11.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杀了他 父亲 准将……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Shoot him!   -Father! Commodore...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.95,0:17:13.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}·.·你要杀死我的恩人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...do you intend to kill my rescuer?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.37,0:17:23.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要好好谢谢你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I believe thanks are in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.80,0:17:30.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你被东印公司逮捕过 对吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Had a brush with the East India Trading Company, did we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.68,0:17:31.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海盗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.22,0:17:34.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把他吊死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hang him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.60,0:17:37.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瞄他 把他鳄住\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep your guns on him, men. Gillette, fetch some irons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.60,0:17:39.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.98,0:17:42.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}克史派罗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack Sparrow, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.56,0:17:45.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是克史派罗船长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Captain Jack Sparrow, if you please, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.27,0:17:47.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没看到你的船……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I don't see your ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.19,0:17:48.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}史船长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}.. captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.48,0:17:50.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我正打算买一艘\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm in the market, as it were.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.86,0:17:52.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他他要偷一艘船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He said he'd come to commandeer one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.95,0:17:55.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就他没 这些是他的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told you he was telling the truth. These are his, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.20,0:18:02.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有一发子弹的手枪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No additional shots nor powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.17,0:18:06.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}指不了北的罗盘\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A compass that doesn't point north.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.01,0:18:13.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这也是破铁\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I half expected it to be made from wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.18,0:18:19.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是我过最避的海盗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are, without doubt, the worst pirate I've heard of.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.10,0:18:21.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少你过我的大名\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But you have heard of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.48,0:18:26.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要郑重向你抗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Commodore, I really must protest!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.19,0:18:28.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小心点 ，上尉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Carefully, lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.73,0:18:31.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他救了我一命\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pirate or not, this man saved my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.07,0:18:34.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只做一件好事 抵不 了一生的恶行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One good deed is not enough to redeem a man of a lifetime of wickedness!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.70,0:18:36.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过至少能抵我一命\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But it seems enough to condemn him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.53,0:18:37.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.45,0:18:40.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这才像话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.37,0:18:43.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别开枪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.58,0:18:44.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就知道你喜欢我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I Knew you'd warm up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.00,0:18:47.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的东西还我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Commodore Norrington, my effects, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.88,0:18:49.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有我的帽子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And my hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.21,0:18:51.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准将\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Commodore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.42,0:18:57.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊莉莎白 对吧？ 我是史小姐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Elizabeth. It is Elizabeth, isn't it?   -It's Miss Swann.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.51,0:19:00.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}史小姐 麻你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Miss Swann, if you'd be so kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.10,0:19:02.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点 时间不多了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come, dear, we don't have all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.06,0:19:05.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}个忙 行？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, if you'll be very kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.87,0:19:23.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}轻一点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Easy on the goods, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.33,0:19:26.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是个大壤蛋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're despicable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.87,0:19:28.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}无所啦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sticks and stones, love.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.92,0:19:30.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我救你 你救我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saved your life, you save mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.59,0:19:31.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咱们扯平了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're square.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.59,0:19:33.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各位\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.88,0:19:35.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小姐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}my lady...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.42,0:19:38.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}永远记得今天 你们差点抓到……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... you will always remember this as the day you almost caught...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.84,0:19:41.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鼎鼎大名的史克船长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Captain Jack Sparrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.86,0:20:01.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们为啥不开枪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, will you shoot him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.41,0:20:03.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开枪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.38,0:20:11.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}追上去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Burn his heels!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.23,0:20:29.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Take cover, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.31,0:20:31.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吉力\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gillette...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.31,0:20:34.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}史先生跟绞架有约\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Mr. Sparrow has a dawn appointment with the gallows.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.53,0:20:36.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别他爽约了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I would hate for him to miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.53,0:20:41.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快去追\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Search upstairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.28,0:20:44.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}眼睛睁大点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look lively, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.75,0:22:19.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一动也没动\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right where I left you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.43,0:22:28.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你动过了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not where I left you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.86,0:22:40.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们在追捕你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're the one they're hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.69,0:22:42.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是海盗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.61,0:22:46.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你很眼熟 我过你？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You seem somewhat familiar. Have I threatened you before?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.78,0:22:49.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一向不跟海盗打交道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I make a point of avoiding familiarity with pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.62,0:22:53.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我就你破例了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It would be a shame to put a black mark on your record.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.37,0:22:54.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So if you'll excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.38,0:23:00.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这做好？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you think this wise, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.50,0:23:04.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟一个海盗比剑 ？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Crossing blades with a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.76,0:23:06.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你威叠史小姐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You threatened Miss Swann.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.18,0:23:10.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有一点点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Only a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.11,0:23:27.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的剑法不错 好样的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what you're doing, I'll give you that. Excellent form.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.16,0:23:29.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的上功夫如何？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But how's your footwork?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.95,0:23:32.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是我走一步·.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I step here...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.41,0:23:34.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.87,0:23:36.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我再走一步……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And now I step again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.67,0:23:43.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ta.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.90,0:24:04.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这一招挺炫的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is a wonderful trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.86,0:24:09.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是你又描住我的出路\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Except, once again, you are between me and my way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.62,0:24:10.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.37,0:24:12.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你手上没有武器\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... you have no weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.14,0:24:36.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些剑是做的呀？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who makes all these?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.23,0:24:39.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.64,0:24:43.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且我每天三小时剑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I practice with them... ... three hours a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.40,0:24:47.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想把马子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You need to find yourself a girl, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.24,0:24:57.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可能你每天三小时剑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or... perhaps the reason you practice three hours a day
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.25,0:24:59.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是为了你所爱慕的女人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is that you already found one,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.16,0:25:02.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是太避了把不到这马子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and are otherwise incapable of wooing said strumpet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.84,0:25:05.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不是太吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not a eunuch, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.38,0:25:09.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我每天三小时剑 是为了看到海盗就杀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I practice three hours a day so that when I meet a pirate, I can kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.13,0:26:28.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你使\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You cheated.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.17,0:26:29.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是海盗呀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.01,0:26:35.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开 不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Move away!   -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.09,0:26:36.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请你开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please move?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.51,0:26:37.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.55,0:26:40.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能你逃走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I cannot just step aside and let you escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.89,0:26:44.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这发子弹不是为你留的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This shot is not meant for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.24,0:26:57.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在那儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There he is! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.24,0:27:01.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得好 布朗师傅\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excellent work, Mr. Brown.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.20,0:27:05.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你协助我们逮到江洋大盗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've assisted in the capture of a dangerous fugitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.16,0:27:07.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是一份心力\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just doing my civic duty, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.46,0:27:11.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们要永远记住这一天\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I trust you will always remember that this is the day
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.13,0:27:14.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我差点就史克船长逃走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Captain Jack Sparrow almost escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.59,0:27:16.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把他带走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.47,0:27:23.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}狗狗 过来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come here, boy!   -Smell it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.60,0:27:26.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想啃香喷的骨头？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come here, boy!   -You want a nice, juicy bone?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.73,0:27:29.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来呀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey!   -Come here, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.23,0:27:31.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有用啦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come here, boy!   -You can keep doing that forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.82,0:27:34.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那狗不会来的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The dog is never going to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.07,0:27:38.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}歹势哦 要被吊死的人是你耶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, excuse us if we haven't resigned ourselves to the gallows just yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.41,0:27:40.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.08,0:27:46.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}早点睡吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There you go, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.42,0:27:49.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你今天辛苦了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was a difficult day for you, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.25,0:27:52.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道倪准将会向我求婚 只是·\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I suspected Commodore Norrington would propose,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.00,0:27:54.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还没有心理准备\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I must admit, I wasn't entirely prepared for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.67,0:27:56.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是你被海盗挟持的事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I meant you being threatened by that pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.97,0:27:58.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好可怕哦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sounds terrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.97,0:28:01.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是很可怕\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh... Yes, it was terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.76,0:28:03.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准将向你求婚耶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But... the Commodore proposed!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.85,0:28:05.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老实\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fancy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.52,0:28:09.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们真是门当户对\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now that's a smart match, miss, if it's not too bold to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.40,0:28:10.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的确是门当户对\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is a smart match.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.94,0:28:13.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是个好男人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's a fine man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.03,0:28:17.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每个女人梦想的白马王子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's what any woman should dream of marrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.61,0:28:20.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个威尔杜纳\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that Will Turner,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.78,0:28:22.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他也是好男人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}he's a fine man, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.99,0:28:24.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也未免太鸡婆了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is too bold.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.87,0:28:26.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, beggin' your pardon, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.00,0:28:28.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不该多嘴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was not my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.71,0:29:20.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我女儿答应你了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Has my daughter given you an answer yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.80,0:29:22.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, she hasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.55,0:29:24.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她今天受了不少\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, she has had a very trying day.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.56,0:29:28.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天气真恶劣\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ghastly weather, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.81,0:29:30.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太阴暗了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bleak. Really bleak.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.48,0:29:33.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什声音？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.56,0:29:36.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cannon fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.82,0:29:39.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快反撃\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Return fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.74,0:29:41.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得这些声\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I Know those guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.74,0:29:49.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鬼盗船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's the Pearl!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.83,0:29:51.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鬼盗船？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Black Pearl?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.04,0:29:55.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我过传\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've heard stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.71,0:29:59.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鬼盗船这十年来 一直攻擎船隽港口\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's been preying on ships and settlements for near ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.80,0:30:01.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来不留下活口\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Never leaves any Survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.47,0:30:02.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不留下活口 ？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.93,0:30:05.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那这些傅是哪来的 ？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then where do the stories come from, I wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.06,0:30:16.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Clear the dock!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.63,0:30:40.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}On your oars!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.48,0:31:40.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瞄对方火\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sight the muzzle flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.15,0:31:41.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Aim for the flashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.23,0:31:43.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}向对方船首船尾开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need a full spread, fore and aft.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.36,0:31:45.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}补充弹药\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Stevens, more cartridges!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.90,0:31:49.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总督 躲进我的办公室\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Governor! Barricade yourself in my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.99,0:31:50.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Good God!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.03,0:31:52.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是命令\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.89,0:32:11.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别开门\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.68,0:32:13.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈，月 朋友\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, chum.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.10,0:32:19.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在上面\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Up there! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.45,0:32:32.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小姐 他们要来抓你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Miss! They've come to kidnap you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.20,0:32:34.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什 你是总督千金呀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What?   -You're the governor's daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.87,0:32:36.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}躲在这儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.71,0:32:41.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们没看到你 先躲起来 有机会就逃\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They haven't seen you. Hide, and the first chance you get, run to the fort!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.47,0:32:53.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}逮到你了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Got ya! Haven't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.52,0:33:00.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好烫哦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No! No! It's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.23,0:33:02.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我烧起来了 走了啦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'm burning!   -Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.53,0:33:07.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快来，弟兄们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, me lads!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.60,0:33:36.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.02,0:33:48.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们知道你在这儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We know you're here, poppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.94,0:33:51.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小妞\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Poppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.20,0:33:52.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快出来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come out...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.16,0:33:55.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们答应不伤害你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and we promise we won't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.45,0:33:56.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.45,0:34:00.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们一定要找到你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We will find you, poppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.50,0:34:03.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你身上有一样东西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've got something of ours,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.96,0:34:05.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}召唤我们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and it calls to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.47,0:34:13.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}黄金在召唤我们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The gold calls to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.01,0:34:16.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}黄金、黄金\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.31,0:34:24.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, poppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.90,0:34:25.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谈判\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Parley!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.61,0:34:27.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.86,0:34:30.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要求谈判\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Parley. I invoke the right of parley.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.61,0:34:34.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}根据摩氏巴海盗誓约\N{\rEN\blur0.8}According to the code of brethren, set down by pirates Morgan and Bartholomew,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.61,0:34:37.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可以跟船长谈判 我知道啦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-you have to take me to your captain.   -I know the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.78,0:34:41.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果方要求判 就不能伤害他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If an adversary demands parley, you can do them no harm
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.54,0:34:43.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}管它的什誓约\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-until the parley is complete.   -To blazes with the code!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.42,0:34:45.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她要见船长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She wants to be taken to the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.88,0:34:49.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她肯乖乖去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And she'll go, without a fuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.21,0:34:53.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要遵守誓约\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We must honor the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.89,0:35:05.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说再见吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Say goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.98,0:35:11.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.99,0:35:17.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}威尔 快走 伊莉莎白\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come on!   -Elizabeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.78,0:35:19.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.58,0:35:28.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我开 ，混蛋 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Out of my way, scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.80,0:35:43.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真同情你 你有衰了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My sympathies, friend. You've no manner of luck at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.29,0:36:07.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来呀 狗狗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, doggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.62,0:36:09.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只剩下你跟我了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just you and me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.58,0:36:11.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咱们俩相依为命\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's you and old Jack. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.04,0:36:13.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快来呀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. That's a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.80,0:36:15.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来啃骨头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good boy. Come get your bone!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.05,0:36:18.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乖狗狗 再过来一点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's a good boy. Come on, a bit closer, a bit closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.01,0:36:22.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就对了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's it! That's it, doggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.10,0:36:26.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这赁的皮狗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, you filthy, slimy, mangy cur!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.77,0:36:28.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别跑嘛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't do that. No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.48,0:36:30.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是故意你啦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't mean it! I didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.03,0:36:38.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这儿不是刀枪室\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This ain't the armory!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.28,0:36:41.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.57,0:36:44.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你瞧瞧这是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look what we have here, Twigg.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.54,0:36:46.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}史克船长 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Captain Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.79,0:36:49.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上回看到你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Last time I saw you,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.00,0:36:51.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一个人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you were all alone
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.88,0:36:54.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}被丢在无人荒岛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on a godforsaken island,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.67,0:36:56.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看著咱们离你远去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}shrinking into the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.96,0:36:59.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的运气还是很背\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His fortunes aren't improved much.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.55,0:37:02.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们自求多福吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Worry about your own fortunes, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.01,0:37:07.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}背叛者会被打下十八层地狱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The deepest circle of hell is reserved for betrayers and mutineers.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.81,0:37:13.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}果然有魔咒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So there is a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.02,0:37:16.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有意思\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.48,0:37:18.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你才不知道地是什\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know nothing of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.41,0:37:29.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很有意思\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's very interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.87,0:38:07.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不需要人质\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't know we was takin' on captives.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.49,0:38:10.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她要求和巴船长谈判\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's invoked the right of parley with Captain Barbossa.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.62,0:38:14.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是来判…… 给我乖乖闲嘴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-1am here to negotia...   -You will speak when spoken to!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.46,0:38:17.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她受到海盗誓约保护\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And ye will not lay a hand on those
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.59,0:38:20.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能动她\N{\rEN\blur0.8}under the protection of parley.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.63,0:38:21.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}遵命 船长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.51,0:38:26.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My apologies, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.51,0:38:28.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}巴船长……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Captain Barbossa,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.89,0:38:33.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是来进行停火谈判的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am here to negotiate the cessation of hostilities against Port Royal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.40,0:38:38.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这番话起来冠冕堂皇 咱们只是小海盗耶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A lot of long words in there, miss. We are not but humble pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.53,0:38:41.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底要什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is it that you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.19,0:38:43.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要你离开别再回来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want you to leave and never come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.95,0:38:48.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我对你的要求恕难从命\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm disinclined to acquiesce to your request.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.16,0:38:52.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}意思是想都别想\N{\rEN\blur0.8}M eans " no."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.92,0:38:54.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.63,0:38:59.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要把它丢下去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.55,0:39:07.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船上都是金银财宝 我们才不屑一枚金牌咧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Me holds are burstin' with swag! That bit of shine matters to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.30,0:39:09.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.43,0:39:12.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是你一直在找的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's what you've been searching for.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.77,0:39:14.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得这艘船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I recognize the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.52,0:39:17.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在八年前看过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw it eight years ago on the crossing from England!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.44,0:39:18.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.61,0:39:22.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.61,0:39:25.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}既然你们不屑一顾\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I suppose if it is worthless,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.28,0:39:27.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就把它丢掉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}then there's no point in me keeping it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.41,0:39:28.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.38,0:39:41.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你叫什名字？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have a name, missy?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.59,0:39:43.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊莉莎白……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Elizabeth...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.72,0:39:45.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杜纳\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... burner.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.18,0:39:48.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是总督府的女慵\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm a maid in the governor's household.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.56,0:39:52.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杜小姐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Miss Turner!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.18,0:39:55.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杜纳！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Turner!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.48,0:39:56.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鞋带\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bootstrap!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.94,0:40:03.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个慵人怎会有这宝贝 ？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And how does a maid come to own a trinket such as that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.65,0:40:06.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是传家之宝？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Family heirloom, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.32,0:40:08.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是偷来的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't steal it, if that's what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.41,0:40:13.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧 把金牌给我 我就离开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very well. You hand it over, we'll put your town to our rudder,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.58,0:40:14.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}永远不回来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and ne'er return.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.51,0:40:29.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要守信用\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Our bargain?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.51,0:40:34.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把大收起来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Still the guns and stow 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.39,0:40:37.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}备启航\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Signal the men, set the flags and make good to clear port.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.31,0:40:39.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要先送我上岸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait! You have to take me to shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.06,0:40:41.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}根据海盗誓约规定.·\N{\rEN\blur0.8}According to the code of the order of the brethren...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.77,0:40:45.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第一 你没要求我送你上岸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your return to shore was not part of our negotiation nor our agreements,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.53,0:40:46.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我什也不必做\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so I must do nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.78,0:40:49.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第二 这是海盗誓约\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Secondly, you must be a pirate for the pirate's code to apply,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.91,0:40:51.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你又不是海盗 第三……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you're not, and thirdly...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.57,0:40:55.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海盗誓约只是用来参考的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...the code is more of what you'd call a guideline, instead of actual rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.91,0:40:58.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎光临鬼盗船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome aboard the Black Pearl,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.37,0:40:59.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杜小姐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Miss Turner.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.56,0:41:22.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们抓走了伊莉莎白\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They've taken her! They've taken Elizabeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.06,0:41:25.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把这个人带下去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Murtogg, remove this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.23,0:41:28.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要提快去救她\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have to hunt them down! We must save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.40,0:41:30.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你打算徙何追起？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And where do you propose we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.70,0:41:35.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有我女儿的消息就快\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you have any information concerning my daughter, please share it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.66,0:41:39.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个史克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That Jack Sparrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.50,0:41:41.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他提到了鬼盗船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He talked about the Black Pear.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.79,0:41:43.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他只是顺口\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mentioned it is more what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.29,0:41:48.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去问他鬼盗船在哪儿 他可以带我们去找\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ask him where it is! Make a deal with him, he could lead us to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.46,0:41:49.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.05,0:41:53.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海盗没把他救走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The pirates who invaded this fort left Sparrow locked in his cell,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.43,0:41:56.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以他们不是同\N{\rEN\blur0.8}ergo they are not his allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.47,0:41:59.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们会估计他们的航向……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Governor, we will establish their most likely course...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.56,0:42:01.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这还不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's not good enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.48,0:42:03.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杜先生……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Turner...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.48,0:42:07.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不是军人或水手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... you are not a military man, you are not a sailor.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.07,0:42:09.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只是个铁匠\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are a blacksmith.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.48,0:42:12.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请你别意氯用事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And this is not the moment for rash actions!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.61,0:42:17.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别以为这儿只有你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do not make the mistake of thinking you are the only man here
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.70,0:42:19.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}才关心伊莉莎白\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who cares for Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.21,0:42:26.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.34,0:42:32.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你 姓史的 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You! Sparrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.63,0:42:33.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干嘛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aye?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.68,0:42:36.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道鬼盗船？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are familiar with that ship, the Black Pearl?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.34,0:42:37.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是有过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.80,0:42:40.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它都停泊在哪儿？ 停泊在哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where does it make berth?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.48,0:42:43.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没过传？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have you not heard the stories?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.15,0:42:47.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}巴船长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Captain Barbossa
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.15,0:42:48.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和他手下的海盗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and his crew of miscreants
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.98,0:42:51.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都是徙可怕的死亡之岛出发\N{\rEN\blur0.8}sail from the dreaded Isla de Muerte.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.65,0:42:54.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有人找得到那座小岛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's an island that cannot be found, except
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.49,0:42:57.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除了知道它下落的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}by those who already know where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.66,0:42:59.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那艘船是真的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The ship's real enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.37,0:43:02.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这座小岛一定存在 在哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}therefore its anchorage must be a real place. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.83,0:43:05.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你干嘛问我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why ask me?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.04,0:43:07.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为你是海盗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because you're a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.34,0:43:10.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也想当海盗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you want to turn pirate yourself. Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.26,0:43:12.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}死都不肯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.01,0:43:17.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们抓走了史小姐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They took Miss Swann.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.72,0:43:19.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你果然有喜欢的对象\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So it is that you found a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.64,0:43:21.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我明白了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.52,0:43:24.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你打算英雄救美人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you're intending to brave all, hasten to her rescue,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.35,0:43:26.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赢得美女的芳心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and so, win fair lady's heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.35,0:43:28.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只能一个人去干\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... you'll have to do it alone, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.02,0:43:31.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这件事对我又没好处\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I see no profit in it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.19,0:43:33.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可以把你放走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.53,0:43:35.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}匙 跑 掉了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How's that? The key's run off.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.24,0:43:36.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我忙盖了这些牢房\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I helped build these cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.95,0:43:39.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些都是铁锭鲛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These are half-pin barrel hinges.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.99,0:43:44.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要用横悍原理用力撑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With the right leverage, and the proper application of strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.41,0:43:46.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}牢门就会开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the door will lift free.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.21,0:43:50.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你叫什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.54,0:43:52.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}威尔杜纳\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will Turner.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.76,0:43:56.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}威尔是威廉的小名\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That would be short for William, I imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.18,0:43:57.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好名字\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good, strong name.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.34,0:44:00.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一定跟你父亲同名\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No doubt named for your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.01,0:44:03.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.85,0:44:07.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杜先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, Mr. Turner,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.23,0:44:08.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我改变主意了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've changed me mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.10,0:44:12.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只要把我放了 我就发誓\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you spring me from this cell, I swear, on pain of death,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.19,0:44:14.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会带你找到鬼盗船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I shall take you to the Black Pearl,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.44,0:44:16.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和你的马子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and your bonny lass.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.20,0:44:18.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就一言为定？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do we have an accord?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.70,0:44:23.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一言为定 好吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Agreed.   -Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.58,0:44:24.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}救我出去吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.25,0:44:32.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}趁他们没发现快走吧 我要拿我的东西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hurry! Someone will have heard that.   -Not without my effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.63,0:44:40.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要偷一艘船？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're going to steal the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.93,0:44:42.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那艘？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.01,0:44:44.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是偷\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Commandeer.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.93,0:44:47.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们微收\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're going to commandeer that ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.27,0:44:48.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是航海术语\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nautical term.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.02,0:44:52.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要问你一个问题\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One question about your business, boy, or there's no use going.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.69,0:44:54.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个女孩子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.28,0:44:56.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你为救她意做多大牲？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... how far are you willing to go to save her?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.07,0:44:58.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我意为她牲生命\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd die for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.45,0:44:59.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.74,0:45:01.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我就放心了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No worries then.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.76,0:45:23.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不是疯子就是天才\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is either madness or brilliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.10,0:45:27.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}疯子和天才只有一线之隔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's remarkable how often those two traits coincide.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.38,0:46:01.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家请冷静 我们要接管这艘船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everyone stay calm! We're taking over the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.26,0:46:02.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}千万别反抗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aye! Avast!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.18,0:46:08.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有雨个人开不了船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This ship cannot be crewed by two men.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.39,0:46:11.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你对开不出港口\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll never make it out of the bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.23,0:46:12.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Son...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.90,0:46:16.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可是鼎鼎大名的 史克船长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I'm Captain Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.82,0:46:18.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你瞭？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Savvy?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.86,0:46:22.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准将\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Commodore!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.99,0:46:25.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们走无畏号\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir! They're taking the Dauntless!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.20,0:46:28.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Commodore!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.37,0:46:30.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们把船走了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're taking the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.46,0:46:34.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}史克和杜威尔把船走了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sparrow and Turner! They're taking the Dauntless!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.17,0:46:35.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}姓杜的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rash, Turner.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.54,0:46:37.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你太衡动了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Too rash.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.75,0:46:42.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是我见过最避的海盗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He is, without doubt, the worst pirate I have ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.26,0:46:47.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.39,0:46:54.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}掉头 ，快掉头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bring her around! Bring her around!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.19,0:47:04.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我头到尾彻底搜 哪儿都别漏掉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Search every cabin, every hold, down to the bilges.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.38,0:47:23.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大儿 ，快 快回截者号去 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sailors, back to the lnterceptor! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.26,0:47:33.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你我们 把帆都升起来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, Commodore, for getting us ready to make way.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.27,0:47:35.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只靠我们俩肯定不行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'd have had a hard time of it by ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.11,0:47:41.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}扬帆 追上去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Set topsails and clear up this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.23,0:47:43.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们对追不上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With the wind a quarter astern, we won't catch them!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.86,0:47:47.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不必追上他们 只要到射程就行了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't need to. Just get them in range of the long nines.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.86,0:47:50.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把大搬出来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hands, come about! Run out the guns! Bring out the guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.45,0:47:53.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要掉自 己的船？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are to fire on our own ship, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.12,0:47:56.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我宁把它撃沉 也不它落进海盗手中\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd rather see her at the bottom of the ocean than in the hands of a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.25,0:47:59.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Commodore!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.50,0:48:01.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他把舵开了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's disabled the rudder chain, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.30,0:48:06.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快秉船 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Abandon ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.64,0:48:16.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是我见过最属害的海盗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's got to be the best pirate I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.31,0:48:19.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看来是如此\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.57,0:48:30.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我小时候住在英国\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When I was a lad, living in England,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.49,0:48:32.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我妈一手把我拉拔大\N{\rEN\blur0.8}my mother raised me by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.54,0:48:34.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她死后我就来这儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After she died, I came out here,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.58,0:48:36.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来找我爸爸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}looking for my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.87,0:48:39.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.21,0:48:41.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爸是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My father,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.84,0:48:43.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比尔杜纳\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bill Turner?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.30,0:48:46.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到我的名字才答应忙\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At the jail, it was only after you learned my name that you agreed to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.97,0:48:49.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你肯忙我就没再多问\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Since that's what I wanted, I didn't press the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.72,0:48:51.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过我不是傻瓜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not a simpleton, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.34,0:48:53.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你识我爸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You knew my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.52,0:49:00.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是识他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.65,0:49:03.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是少数叫他威廉杜尔的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Probably one of the few who knew him as William Turner.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.65,0:49:07.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其他人都叫他鞋带比尔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everyone else just called him "Bootstrap," or "Bootstrap Bill."
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.15,0:49:08.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鞋带\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bootstrap?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.16,0:49:11.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是个好海盗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good man. Good pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.66,0:49:13.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跟他长得一模一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I swear, you look just like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.83,0:49:14.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不对\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.91,0:49:16.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是个商船水手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was a merchant sailor.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.79,0:49:19.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个奉公守法的好人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A good, respectable man who obeyed the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.12,0:49:21.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是个海盗 人渣\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was a bloody pirate, a scallywag.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.67,0:49:25.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我父亲不是海盗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My father was not a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.55,0:49:28.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把剑放下来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put it away, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.63,0:49:30.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想再把你打败\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not worth you getting beat again.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.63,0:49:31.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没把我打败\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You didn't beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.84,0:49:35.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不守规则 要不然我早就杀了你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You ignored the rules of engagement. In a fair fight, I'd kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.22,0:49:38.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可不讲究公不公平\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's not much incentive for me to fight fair, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.40,0:49:48.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你给我好了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now as long as you're just hanging there, pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.74,0:49:51.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}唯一的规则是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The only rules that really matter are these:
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.32,0:49:55.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有所为有所不为\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What a man can do, and what a man can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.91,0:50:00.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以接受你爸是个海盗 也是个好人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For instance, you can accept that your father was a pirate and a good man,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.37,0:50:01.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者不接受\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.46,0:50:05.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过你得承 你流著海盗的血\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pirate is in your blood, boy, so you'll have to square with that someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.88,0:50:08.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至于我 我可以你淹死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, me, for example. I could let you drown,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.09,0:50:12.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是我一个人 开不到土图嘉港 懂 ？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I can't bring this ship into Tortuga all by me onesies. Savvy?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.93,0:50:13.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因此\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.97,0:50:22.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底是意海盗的命令\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you sail under the command of a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.56,0:50:24.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是不意？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or can you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.61,0:50:28.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}土图嘉港？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tortuga?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.73,0:50:30.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tortuga.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.55,0:50:56.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没闻过土图嘉港美妙的气味\N{\rEN\blur0.8}More importantly, it is indeed a sad life that has never breathed deep
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.68,0:51:00.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这子就算白活了 瞭？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the sweet, proliferous bouquet that is Tortuga. Savvy?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.89,0:51:03.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得怎样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.31,0:51:08.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不怎样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It'll linger.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.48,0:51:12.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来告你 要是每个港口都跟这儿一样好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll tell you, mate, if every town in the world were like this one,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.57,0:51:15.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}男人都会乐不思蜀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}no man would ever feel unwanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.99,0:51:18.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}思嘉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Scarlett!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.99,0:51:21.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我好像不该被打耶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not sure I deserved that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.12,0:51:24.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}洁芮\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Giselle!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.33,0:51:25.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who was she?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.42,0:51:26.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啥米 ？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.71,0:51:30.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这次我好像是活该\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I may have deserved that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.26,0:51:35.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}猪头 你在搞什玩意儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Curse you for breathing, you slack-jawed idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.72,0:51:39.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的老天\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mother's love!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.93,0:51:40.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.93,0:51:45.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不该把我吵醒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You should know better than to wake a man when he's sleepin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.14,0:51:49.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这会带来霉运 我有办法去除霉运\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It's bad luck.   -Fortunately, I Know how to counter it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.11,0:51:52.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请被叫醒的倒媚鬼喝一杯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The man who did the waking buys the man who was sleeping a drink,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.48,0:51:55.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后叫醒他的那个人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and the man who was sleeping drinks while listening to a proposition
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.99,0:51:57.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出一个好提\N{\rEN\blur0.8}from the man who did the waking.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.87,0:52:01.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧 这样就行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aye, that'll about do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.54,0:52:08.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可恶 ，我已经醒啦 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Blast! I'm already awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.88,0:52:10.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是为了冲掉臭味\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was for the smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.72,0:52:22.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}招子放亮点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep a sharp eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.36,0:52:30.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这次……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.52,0:52:32.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你又在打什主意？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...what's the nature of this venture of you'rn?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.82,0:52:36.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要去找鬼盗船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm going after the Black Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.74,0:52:42.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道它的下落\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I Know where it's going to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.28,0:52:44.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要把它回来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I'm gonna take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.12,0:52:48.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这是自寻死路\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack, it's a fool's errand!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.58,0:52:51.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你比我更清楚鬼盗船的传\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you know better than me the tales of the Black Pear!!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.96,0:52:54.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也知道巴船长的使俩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's why I know what Barbossa is up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.09,0:52:56.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只需要船员\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All I need is a crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.13,0:53:02.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}巴船长老奸巨猾 他也不会轻易放手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What I hear tell of Captain Barbossa, he's not a man to suffer fools, nor strike a bargain with one!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.26,0:53:04.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}幸好我也不笨\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd say it's a good thing I'm not a fool, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.60,0:53:05.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你倒是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Prove me wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.35,0:53:09.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}姓巴的干嘛 要把鬼盗船交给你 ？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What makes you think Barbossa will give up his ship to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.77,0:53:13.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}姑且我有很好的等码\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's just say it's a matter of leverage, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.33,0:53:30.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那小子？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.92,0:53:34.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是比尔杜纳的儿子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is the child of Bootstrap Bill Turner.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.00,0:53:38.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的独子 瞭？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His only child. Savvy?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.55,0:53:40.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is he now?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.43,0:53:45.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你手上的确有很好的等码\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Leverage, says you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.89,0:53:48.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这下就有胜算了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think I feel a change in the wind, says I.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.93,0:53:50.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我替你找船员\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll find us a crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.35,0:53:53.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一定有跟你一样疯的水手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's bound to be some sailors on this rock, crazy as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.36,0:53:55.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望如此\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One can only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.77,0:53:58.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杀人不眨眼 手下不留情\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Take what you can!   -Give nothin' back!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.38,0:54:25.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要跟船长共进晚餐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll be dining with the captain,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.22,0:54:27.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他要你穿这个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and he requests you wear this.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.56,0:54:32.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就跟他 我对他的要求恕难命\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell the captain I'm "disinclined to acquiesce to his request."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.31,0:54:35.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他就你会这\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He said you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.65,0:54:38.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他还如果你这\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He also said, if that be the case...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.11,0:54:39.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就得脱光光\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... you'll be dining with the crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.90,0:54:41.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟船员吃饭\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you'll be naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.20,0:54:49.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.93,0:55:09.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不用客氯，这儿没别人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's no need to stand on ceremony no call to impress anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.56,0:55:11.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一定了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You must be hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.37,0:55:30.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喝口酒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Try the wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.42,0:55:38.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再吃一颗巅果\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the apples. One of those next.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.72,0:55:48.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你下了毒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.93,0:55:52.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我用不著杀你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There would be no sense to be killing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.31,0:55:55.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就放了我 你拿到了金子 我对你没用 了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then release me. You have your trinket. I'm of no further value to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.77,0:56:03.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不知道这是什吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't know what this is, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.36,0:56:05.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是海盗金牌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a pirate medallion.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.65,0:56:07.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是厄兹提金\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is Aztec gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.62,0:56:11.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一共有882枚金\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One of 882 identical pieces
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.45,0:56:15.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放在石箱送给柯帝兹本人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}they delivered in a stone chest to Cortés himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.12,0:56:20.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是他大开杀戒 搜刮来的财宝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Blood money paid to stem the slaughter he wreaked upon them with his armies.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.42,0:56:24.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的婪无止无\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But the greed of Cortés was insatiable.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.30,0:56:27.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}于是神明在金上面\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So the heathen gods placed upon the gold...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.68,0:56:31.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下了可怕的魔咒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...a terrible curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.93,0:56:37.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要有人石箱取出金\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Any mortal that removes but a single piece from that stone chest...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.19,0:56:40.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就会永远受到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...shall be punished for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.98,0:56:46.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我才不相信这种鬼故事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hardly believe in ghost stories any more, Captain Barbossa.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.49,0:56:47.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.49,0:56:51.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们一开始也不信\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's exactly what I thought when we were first told the tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.03,0:56:54.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些金被藏在死亡之岛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Buried on an Isle of the Dead what cannot be found,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.00,0:56:56.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道它下落的人才找得到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}except for those who know where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.58,0:56:59.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们找到了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Find it, we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.58,0:57:04.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}果然有一个装满金的石箱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There be the chest. Inside be the gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.76,0:57:08.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们把金全都拿走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And we took 'em all!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.22,0:57:11.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们把这些金全都花掉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We spent 'em and traded 'em, and frittered 'em away
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.01,0:57:14.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大吃大喝 玩女人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on drink and food and pleasurable company.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.85,0:57:16.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们花的金越多\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The more we gave 'em away,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.89,0:57:19.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就慢慢发现……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the more we came to realize...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.85,0:57:23.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}酒怎喝也喝不过瘾\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...the drink would not satisfy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.27,0:57:27.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}美食进了嘴就变成泥沙\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Food turned to ash in our mouths...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.69,0:57:32.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}美女也满足不了我们的欲望\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and all the pleasurable company in the world could not slake our lust.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.24,0:57:37.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们受到了咒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are cursed men, Miss Turner.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.79,0:57:41.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们受到婪的使\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Compelled by greed we were, but now...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.46,0:57:44.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在被婪吞蚀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...we are consumed by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.06,0:57:58.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有一个办法能解除魔咒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There is one way we can end our curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.06,0:58:07.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就是把金全都找回来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All the scattered pieces of the Aztec gold must be restored,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.57,0:58:09.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}血债血还\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and the blood repaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.74,0:58:16.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把最后一枚金给了我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks to ye, we have the final piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.37,0:58:20.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}血债血还呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the... blood to be repaid?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.75,0:58:23.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我不会杀你……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's why there's no sense to be killing ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.04,0:58:25.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还不会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.09,0:58:28.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来颗果？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Apple?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.14,0:58:38.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.44,0:58:46.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很好奇\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.52,0:58:49.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你杀了我以后打算做什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After killing me, what is it you're planning on doing next?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.01,0:59:55.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你瞧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.30,0:59:58.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}月光我们露出原形\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The moonlight shows us for what we really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.01,1:00:02.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不是活人 所以死不 了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are not among the living and so we cannot die.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.35,1:00:04.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们也不是死人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But neither are we dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.27,1:00:09.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我早就渴了无法得到满足\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For too long I've been parched of thirst and unable to quench it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.15,1:00:11.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我早就了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Too long I've been starvin' to death,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.61,1:00:13.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可没有死去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and haven't died!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.86,1:00:15.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我感觉不到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I feel nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.45,1:00:19.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吹在我上的海风\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not the wind on my face, nor the spray of the sea...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.78,1:00:22.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也享受不了女人温暖的体\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...nor the warmth of a woman's flesh.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.95,1:00:28.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你最好相信鬼故事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You best start believing in ghost stories, Miss Turner.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.54,1:00:29.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你已身在其中了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're in one!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.60,1:00:50.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看什看 回去斡活\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you looking at? Back to work!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.78,1:01:01.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请你阁吧 船长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Feast your eyes, captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.53,1:01:04.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}水手都到齐了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All of them, faithful hands before the mast.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.54,1:01:07.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每个人都很能斡\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every man worth his salt...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.79,1:01:09.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也跟你一样疯狂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and crazy to boot.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.92,1:01:12.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些就是你的船员 ？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So this is your able-bodied crew?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.59,1:01:19.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你 水手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You, sailor!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.68,1:01:21.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他叫老卡\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cotton, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.09,1:01:22.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卡先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Cotton.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.93,1:01:26.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能命行事 勇往直前？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you have the courage and fortitude to follow orders and stay true
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.35,1:01:27.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}面对死亡无畏无？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in the face of danger and death?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.98,1:01:29.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卡先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Cotton!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.77,1:01:30.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快回答\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Answer, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.94,1:01:32.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是个巴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's a mute, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.44,1:01:34.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的舌头被割了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Poor devil had his tongue cut out.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.23,1:01:36.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他教他的八哥替他讲话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So he trained the parrot to talk for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.36,1:01:38.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天晓得他是怎教的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No one's yet figured how.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.45,1:01:43.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卡先生的八哥\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Cotton's parrot.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.08,1:01:45.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请你回答\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Same question.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.62,1:01:48.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}扬帆 ！扬帆 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When do you sail? When do you sail?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.50,1:01:51.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我猜意思是 可以\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mostly, we figure that means "yes."
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.62,1:01:53.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我猜也是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course it does.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.21,1:01:54.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你满意了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Satisfied?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.17,1:01:57.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只证明他们都是疯子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you've proved they're mad!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.30,1:01:59.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们有什好处？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And what's the benefit for us?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.64,1:02:10.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安娜玛莉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anamaria!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.65,1:02:14.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我猜这次你也不该被打\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I suppose you didn't deserve that one, either.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.06,1:02:16.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 这次是我活该\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, that one I deserved.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.02,1:02:18.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你偷走了我的船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You stole my boat!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.82,1:02:19.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实咧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.99,1:02:24.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是没经过允许就借走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Borrowed. Borrowed, without permission,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.45,1:02:27.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我打算还给你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but with every intention of bringing it back to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.12,1:02:28.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是你没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But you didn't!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.62,1:02:30.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会再得到一艘的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll get another one!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.37,1:02:32.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}1 will!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.46,1:02:34.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}更好的船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A better one. A better one!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.92,1:02:37.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那一艘 哪一艘？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-That one!   -What one?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.22,1:02:41.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那一艘？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That one?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.84,1:02:46.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，那一艘\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aye. That one.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.64,1:02:48.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎样？ 好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What say you?   -Aye!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.31,1:02:49.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aye!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.77,1:02:50.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}起锚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anchors away!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.85,1:02:55.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你带女人上船会倒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no, no, no! It's frightful bad luck to bring a woman aboard, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.69,1:02:58.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不带她上船才会倒大\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It'll be far worse not to have her.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.06,1:03:35.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们用一个掉的罗盘\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How can we sail to an island that nobody can find,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.19,1:03:37.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎到得了找不到的小岛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with a compass that doesn't work?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.73,1:03:39.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个盘指不了北\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aye, the compass doesn't point north,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.73,1:03:42.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过我们又不是要去北方\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but we're not trying to find north, are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.25,1:03:55.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们应该把帆收起来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We should drop canvas, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.71,1:03:57.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它还撑得住\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She can hold a bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.96,1:04:03.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这个节骨眼 你怎还这乐观？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's in your head that's put you in such a fine mood, captain?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.59,1:04:05.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们就快追上了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're catching up.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.61,1:04:22.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该走了 小妞\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Time to go, poppet.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.16,1:05:22.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}死人不话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dead men tell no tales...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.13,1:05:29.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是恐怖到极点 不知道有多少水手死在这儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Puts a chill in the bones, how many honest sailors have been claimed by this passage.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.15,1:05:47.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}克哪儿弄来那个罗盘？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How is it that Jack came by that compass?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.57,1:05:50.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}克到土图嘉港寻找\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not a lot's known about Jack Sparrow 'fore he showed up in Tortuga
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.86,1:05:53.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}死亡之岛宝藏之前是个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with a mind to go after the treasure of Isla de Muerte.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.62,1:05:57.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当时他还是鬼盗船的船长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was before I met him, back when he was captain of the Black Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.00,1:05:59.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.67,1:06:04.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他没提到这件事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He failed to mention that.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.21,1:06:06.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他现在很小心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He plays things closer to the vest now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.55,1:06:08.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为他得到惨痛教训\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And a hard-learned lesson it was.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.72,1:06:11.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当年他的大副\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Three days before the venture, the first mate comes says,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.68,1:06:14.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要求跟他分享一切\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Everything's an equal share. That should mean the location
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.47,1:06:18.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}包括实藏的地点 于是克就告了他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of the treasure, too," so Jack gives up the bearings.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.39,1:06:20.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当晚船员就叛变\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That night, there was a mutiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.60,1:06:24.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们把克丢在荒岛等死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They marooned Jack on an island and left him to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.36,1:06:27.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在那儿差点发疯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But not before he'd gone mad with the heat.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.11,1:06:33.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怪不得他疯疯癫癫的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So that's the reason for all the...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.58,1:06:37.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他天生就疯疯癫癫\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Reason's got nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.24,1:06:43.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们给他一把手枪 一发子弹\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, Will, when a pirate's marooned, he's given a pistol with a single shot. One shot...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.29,1:06:46.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有一发 一发子弹没什用\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that won't do much good hunting, nor to be rescued.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.71,1:06:49.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过了三个礼拜以后\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But after three weeks of a starving belly and thirst,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.96,1:06:53.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那发子弹就很有用\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that pistol starts to look real friendly.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.43,1:06:55.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}幸好克最后荒岛逃出来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But Jack, he escaped the island,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.51,1:06:59.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他把子弹留给一个人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and still has that single shot. He won't use it, though, save on one man.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.77,1:07:02.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}背叛他的大副\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His mutinous first mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.89,1:07:04.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}巴船长 没错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Barbossa.   -Aye.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.10,1:07:09.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是怎逃走的 ？ 信不信由你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-How did Jack get off the island?   -Well, I'll tell ye.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.11,1:07:11.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他泡在海里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He waded out into the shallows,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.28,1:07:13.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}足足泡了三天三夜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and he waited there three days and three nights,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.95,1:07:17.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直到海底生物都习惯了他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}till all manner of sea creatures came acclimated to his presence.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.78,1:07:20.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后在第四天早上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And on the fourth morning,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.41,1:07:24.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他用子套住雨大海 把们当成木筏\N{\rEN\blur0.8}he roped a couple of sea turtles, lashed them together and made a raft.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.79,1:07:30.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他用子套住海 对\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-He roped a couple of sea turtles.   -Aye. Sea turtles!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.84,1:07:34.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他拿什当子？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did he use for rope?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.81,1:07:41.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的毛发\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Human hair.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.39,1:07:43.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的体毛很长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}From my back.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.98,1:07:48.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}降锚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let go the anchor! Lower the anchor line!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.90,1:07:51.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟杜先生要上岸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Young Mr. Turner and I are to go ashore.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.94,1:07:53.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.15,1:07:54.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是你出了事呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What if the worst should happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.74,1:07:58.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就遵守誓约 是 遵命\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Keep to the code.   -Aye. The code.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.31,1:08:27.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这十年来的金银财宝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ten years of hoarding swag!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.35,1:08:29.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}终于可以拿来用 了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And now we finally get to spend it!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.20,1:08:39.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}魔咒一解除我们就发财了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Once we're quit of the curse, we'll be rich men...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.70,1:08:44.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也可以买一颗玻璃假眼球\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and you can buy an eye what actually fits and is made of glass.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.50,1:08:47.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这一颗是有点不舒服\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This one does splinter something terrible!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.50,1:08:49.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别一直揉啦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop rubbing it!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.35,1:09:12.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跟吉 卜的是什誓约？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What code is Gibbs to keep to if the worst should happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.44,1:09:14.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海盗誓约\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The pirates' code.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.82,1:09:16.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是回不去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Any man who falls behind...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.28,1:09:18.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就得留下来等死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...1S left behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.95,1:09:22.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海盗再怎样也变不了英雄\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No heroes amongst thieves.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.95,1:09:26.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这看不起海盗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, for having such a bleak outlook on pirates,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.08,1:09:29.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}做的事情跟海盗一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you're well on your way to becoming one.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.50,1:09:31.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你衡进大牢劫\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sprung a man from jail...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.42,1:09:34.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}偷走皇家海军的船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...commandeered a ship of the fleet,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.96,1:09:37.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟一群海盗航海\N{\rEN\blur0.8}sailed with a buccaneer crew out of Tortuga...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.68,1:09:42.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一心一意想要找到实藏\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and you're completely obsessed with treasure!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.68,1:09:46.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你错了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.52,1:09:49.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我才不想要找宝藏\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am not obsessed with treasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.48,1:09:59.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}实藏不一定就是金银财宝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not all treasure is silver and gold, mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.28,1:10:00.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各位 时候到了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gentlemen, the time has come!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.03,1:10:02.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hurrah!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.70,1:10:04.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们就快得救了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Salvation is nigh!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.91,1:10:06.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.41,1:10:09.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咱们的痛苦即将结束了 伊莉莎白\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Our torment is nearing an end!   -Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.33,1:10:12.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们经过十年来的考\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For ten years, we've been tested and tried,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.62,1:10:14.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每一个人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and each man-jack of you here
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.46,1:10:17.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都历经了千辛万苦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}has proved his mettle 100 times over.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.50,1:10:19.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}无法想像的煎熬 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And 100 times again!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.84,1:10:20.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.97,1:10:23.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我受了折磨\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Suffered, I have!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.30,1:10:26.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们受到的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Punished, we were,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.18,1:10:31.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}远远超过我们犯下的罪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the lot of us, disproportionate to our crime!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.23,1:10:33.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Right!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.10,1:10:34.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是这玩意 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here it is!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.02,1:10:41.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}柯帝兹受咒的宝藏\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The cursed treasure of Cortés himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.61,1:10:46.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们把每一枚金\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every last piece that went astray,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.20,1:10:47.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都放回去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we have returned.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.99,1:10:49.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除了这一枚 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Save for this!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.79,1:10:51.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah!   -Jack!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.29,1:10:53.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还不行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.00,1:10:56.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要等到时机成熟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll wait for the opportune moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.59,1:10:59.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}... despairing of ever finding the lass.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.38,1:11:01.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什时机？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.30,1:11:04.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对你最有利的时机？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When it's of greatest profit to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.05,1:11:05.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我问你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}May I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.76,1:11:09.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这一路上我有过你？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have I ever given you reason not to trust me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.48,1:11:13.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你急著想救人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do us a favor. I Know it's difficult for you,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.69,1:11:15.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过我要你留下来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but please, stay here,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.81,1:11:18.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}试著别做蠢事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and try not to do anything stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.36,1:11:26.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们是不是都为神明流过血？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-And who among us has paid the blood sacrifice - owed to the heathen gods?   -Aye!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.28,1:11:29.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有没有流过血？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And whose blood must yet be paid?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.20,1:11:30.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hers!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.04,1:11:37.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们知道魔咒解除后 我要做什\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know the first thing I'm going to do after the curse is lifted?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.96,1:11:43.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吃一大篮子巅果\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Eat a whole bushel of apples!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.14,1:11:53.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}血债血还\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Begun by blood,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.23,1:11:55.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}解除魔咒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}by blood undone.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.69,1:12:00.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.82,1:12:03.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想当你的等码\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not going to be your leverage.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.58,1:12:14.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.79,1:12:16.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没必要浪费\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Waste not.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.45,1:12:55.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}成功了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did it work?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.83,1:12:58.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得没什不同呀 该怎才知道？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I don't feel no different.   -How do we tell?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.80,1:13:07.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没有死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.34,1:13:09.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.93,1:13:12.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他开枪射我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He shot me!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.30,1:13:13.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有用\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It didn't work!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.89,1:13:15.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}魔咒没被解除\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The curse is still upon us!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.94,1:13:23.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你父亲叫什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You! Maid! Your father, what was his name?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.48,1:13:25.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你爸是威廉杜纳？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Was your father William Turner?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.07,1:13:27.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.36,1:13:30.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的孩子呢？ 八年前来自英国的小孩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's his child? The child that sailed from England eight years ago?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.95,1:13:34.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}威廉杜纳的亲生骨肉呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The child in whose veins flows the blood of William Turner? Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.71,1:13:43.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们两个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You two!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.00,1:13:46.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们找错人了 是啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You brought us the wrong person!   -Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.05,1:13:48.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}才没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.80,1:13:51.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她有金 她的年纪一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She had the medallion! She's the proper age!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.68,1:13:53.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她也她姓杜纳\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She said her name was Turner. You heard her!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.10,1:13:57.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我猜她\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think she lied to us!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.22,1:13:58.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.02,1:14:02.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把我们害惨了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You brought us here for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.40,1:14:06.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们什 把错怪在我头上？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I won't take questionin' or second-guessin' from you, Mr. Twigg!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.61,1:14:07.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什不行？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's to blame him?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.90,1:14:10.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你害我们变得越来越糟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every decision you've made has led us from bad to worse!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.07,1:14:15.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当年是你把杜威廉处死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was you who sent Bootstrap to the depths!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.70,1:14:16.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.50,1:14:22.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也是你把我们带到这鬼地方来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And it's you who brought us here in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.88,1:14:26.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哪个孬种敢我声就开口\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If any coward here dare challenge me, let him speak!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.84,1:14:33.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们干脆把她杀死算了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I say, we cut her throat, and spill all her blood! Just in case.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.59,1:14:34.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.69,1:14:46.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她把金走了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The medallion! She's taken it!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.36,1:14:50.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快追上去 忘恩负义的东西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get after her, you feckless pack of ingrates!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.37,1:14:59.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有耶 咧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Where's the oars?   -There's no oars!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.41,1:15:02.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不见了 快去找\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The oars have gone missing! Find them!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.34,1:15:12.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又是你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.43,1:15:16.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你早就该死了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're supposed to be dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.14,1:15:17.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没死？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Am I not?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.91,1:15:39.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}痰盆……糖葫芦……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...parsnip... pars-ley...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.74,1:15:41.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弹啥米……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Partner, pardoner...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.79,1:15:42.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谈判 ？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Parley?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.87,1:15:44.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对’ 谈判\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the one! Parley!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.46,1:15:47.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谈判\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Parley! Parley?!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.04,1:15:52.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哪个头发明谈判这字？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damned to the depths whatever madman thought of parley!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.47,1:15:56.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一定是法国佬\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That would be the French.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.56,1:16:09.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又是一海盗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not more pirates!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.81,1:16:11.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎上船 大小姐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome aboard, Miss Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.82,1:16:14.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吉 卜先生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Gibbs?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.74,1:16:16.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小子 克呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey boy, where be Jack?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.16,1:16:19.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}史克？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack? Jack Sparrow?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.91,1:16:22.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他提不回来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He fell behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.96,1:16:31.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就遵守誓约\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep to the code!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.76,1:16:35.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}起锚 ！扬帆 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Weigh anchor! Hoist the sails!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.63,1:16:37.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}动作快点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Split-quick, you dibbies!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.52,1:16:46.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是怎逃离那座小岛的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How the blazes did you get off that island?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.98,1:16:51.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把我丢在无人荒岛的时候\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When you marooned me on that godforsaken spit of land,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.48,1:16:53.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}忘了一件很重要的事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you forgot one very important thing, mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.44,1:16:57.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是史克船长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm Captain Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.90,1:17:02.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我这次不会犯同样的错误啦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I won't be making that mistake... ...again.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.58,1:17:07.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各位 你们都记得史船长吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gents, you all remember Captain Jack Sparrow?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.12,1:17:08.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aye.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.08,1:17:10.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杀了他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.58,1:17:13.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那女孩的血没有用 ，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The girl's blood didn't work, did it?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.59,1:17:17.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等一下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.39,1:17:26.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道我们需要的血？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know whose blood we need?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.64,1:17:30.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我当然知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I Know whose blood you need.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.65,1:17:40.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁会用别人的命 换一艘船呀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What sort of a man trades a man's life for a ship?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.32,1:17:41.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个海盗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A pirate.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.74,1:17:45.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here. Let me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.91,1:17:47.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.79,1:17:51.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跟巴船长你姓杜纳\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You said you gave Barbossa my name as yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.25,1:17:54.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.59,1:17:58.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不晓得\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.84,1:18:03.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉 一个铁匠的手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry. A blacksmith's hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.10,1:18:07.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的手太粗糙了 不会啦 是的 可是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I know they're rough.   -No... I mean, yes, they are, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.14,1:18:11.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别停下来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.45,1:18:21.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊莉莎白\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Elizabeth!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.80,1:18:39.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是你的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.55,1:18:46.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为我把它弄丢了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought I'd lost it the day they rescued me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.01,1:18:48.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我父亲的礼物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was a gift from my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.56,1:18:50.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他寄给我的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He sent it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.31,1:18:57.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你为什要拿走？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why did you take it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.98,1:19:02.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我怕你是海盗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because I was afraid that you were a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.32,1:19:06.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那样一来就糟了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That would've been awtul.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.58,1:19:11.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们要的不是你的血\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It wasn't your blood they needed.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.17,1:19:16.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我父亲的血\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was my father's blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.88,1:19:21.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的血\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.39,1:19:27.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个海盗的血\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The blood of a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.85,1:19:29.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起 请原我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will, I'm so sorry. Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.32,1:19:46.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你打算把我丢在荒岛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So you expect to leave me standin' on some beach, with nothing but a name
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.03,1:19:52.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只 留下我要找的人的名字 然后开著我的船扬帆而去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and your word it's the one I need, and watch you sail away in my ship?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.45,1:19:53.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不对\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.71,1:19:57.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我把你丢在荒岛上 啥也不留给你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I expect to leave you standing on some beach with absolutely no name at all,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.88,1:19:59.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要看著我开走我的船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}watching me sail away on my ship,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.04,1:20:02.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后我再大声把名字告你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and then I'll shout the name back to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.01,1:20:04.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瞭？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Savvy?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.38,1:20:07.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样一来 我还是会被丢在荒岛上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That still leaves the problem of me standing on some beach,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.51,1:20:11.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有你告我的一个名字\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with naught but a name and your word it's the one I need.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.39,1:20:13.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跟我两个人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of the two of us,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.81,1:20:17.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有我没有参加叛变\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am the only one who hasn't committed mutiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.69,1:20:21.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你只好相信我的话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Therefore, my word is the one we'll be trusting.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.73,1:20:23.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老实\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Although...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.40,1:20:25.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我倒是要谢谢你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I suppose I should be thanking you because, in fact,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.07,1:20:28.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你没叛变把我丢在荒岛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if you hadn't betrayed me and left me to die,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.58,1:20:33.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就会跟你一样受到咒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I would have an equal share in that curse, same as you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.91,1:20:35.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很刺吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Funny ol' world, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.25,1:20:41.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船长 我们就快追到了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Captain! We're coming up on the Interceptor.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.93,1:20:56.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有一个点子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm having a thought here, Barbossa.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.64,1:20:59.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咱们不如要求停火\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What say we run up a flag of truce,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.52,1:21:01.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我到截者号上面\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I scurry over to the lnterceptor,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.40,1:21:04.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}服他们把金整还给你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I negotiate the return of your medallion. What say you to that?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.82,1:21:09.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就是这笨 才会失去鬼盗船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You see, Jack, that's exactly the attitude that lost you the Pear.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.45,1:21:12.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们死了我就能彻底地搜了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}People are easier to search when they're dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.37,1:21:14.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把他关起来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lock him in the brig.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.96,1:21:29.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把上桅帆开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hands aloft to loose ta'gallants!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.47,1:21:32.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样一来就能全速前进\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With this wind dead astern, she'll carry every sail we've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.85,1:21:34.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎回事？ 鬼盗船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What's happening?   -The Black Pearl!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.02,1:21:36.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}追上来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's gaining on us!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.10,1:21:43.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是加勒比海最快的船耶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is the fastest ship in the Caribbean!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.56,1:21:46.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你自 己去跟他们吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can tell them that after they've caught us!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.36,1:21:48.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们吃水比较 浅，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're shallower on the draft, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.32,1:21:49.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aye.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.40,1:21:51.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不能用这个优势？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can't we lose them amongst those shoals?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.95,1:21:54.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再撑一会儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We don't have to outrun 'em long.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.70,1:21:55.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就能甩掉他们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just long enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.04,1:21:58.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}量减轻船的重量\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lighten the ship! Stem to stern!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.66,1:22:01.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能丢的就量丢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anything we can afford to lose, see that it's lost!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.18,1:22:13.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看来船进水了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Apparently, there's a leak.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.86,1:22:31.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把主桅拉进来，准备开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Haul on the main brace! Make ready the guns!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.07,1:22:33.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伸出长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And run out the sweeps.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.52,1:23:02.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们用得上大\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're gonna need that.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.86,1:23:14.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的点子不错 直到现在\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was a good plan, up till now.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.74,1:23:16.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吉 卜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gibbs!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.24,1:23:17.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不能挨打\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have to make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.74,1:23:19.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一定要反撃 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We must fight!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.08,1:23:22.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把大装满 装什呀？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Load the guns!   -With what?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.25,1:23:24.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什都行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anything! Everything!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.08,1:23:25.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有什就装什\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anything we have left!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.84,1:23:29.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}装满大\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Load the guns!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.88,1:23:31.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}霰弹……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Case shot and langrage!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.67,1:23:33.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}子和碎玻璃\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nails and crushed glass!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.76,1:23:36.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}动作快点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With a will!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.28,1:24:01.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鬼盗船左舷逼近\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Pearl's gonna luff up on our port quarter!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.20,1:24:03.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是攻撃的大好机会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She'll rake us without ever presenting a target!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.83,1:24:05.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}降下右的铁\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lower the anchor on the right side.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.50,1:24:07.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}右舷铁\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On the starboard side!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.00,1:24:12.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这会镶他们措手不及\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It has the element of surprise.   -You're daft, lady!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.13,1:24:13.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们都疯了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You both are!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.22,1:24:14.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就跟克一样疯狂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Daft like Jack!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.34,1:24:16.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}降下右舷铁锚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lower the starboard anchor!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.47,1:24:21.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快呀 否则我就了你们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do it, you gobs, or it's you we'll load into the cannons!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.10,1:24:22.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Aye!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.49,1:24:40.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let go!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.33,1:24:49.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们要急转响\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're club haulin'!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.08,1:24:51.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}向右急转 ，收起右舷 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hard a port! Rack the starboard oars!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.92,1:24:53.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}向右急转\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hard a port!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.06,1:25:06.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}稳住了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep her steady, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.36,1:25:14.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.44,1:25:16.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开火 ！ 全力开火\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.50,1:25:28.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别炸我的船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop blowing holes in my ship!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.09,1:26:17.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还有什点子？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We could use a few more ideas, lass!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.34,1:26:18.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该你想了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's your turn!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.96,1:26:20.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非有奇出现！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We need us a devil's dowry!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.80,1:26:22.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把她交给他们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll give them her!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.14,1:26:24.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们要的不是她\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's not what they're after.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.22,1:26:28.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那枚金\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The medallion!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.91,1:26:53.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把旗子降下来乖乖投降！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Strike your colors, you bloomin' cockroaches!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.29,1:26:56.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各位 拿出锚！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hands, grapnels, at the ready!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.13,1:26:57.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}备登船！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Prepare to board!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.29,1:27:35.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拿出手枪和短刀！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pistols and cutlasses, men!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.17,1:27:37.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老寇 、阿杜 去弹药库！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Koehler and Twigg to the powder magazine!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.50,1:27:40.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其他人把金给我找来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the rest of you, bring me the medallion!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.39,1:27:52.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.62,1:28:11.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在下面！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Below!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.06,1:28:32.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多谢了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.95,1:28:46.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.32,1:28:50.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是空的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bloody empty!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.05,1:29:07.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能欺负女生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's not very nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.56,1:29:13.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}金呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where is the medallion?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.81,1:29:14.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}人！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wretch!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.94,1:29:19.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}威廉呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where is dear William?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.48,1:29:22.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}威廉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.94,1:29:27.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}威廉 伊莉莎白\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Will!   -Elizabeth!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.12,1:29:31.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}臭猴子！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Monkey!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.91,1:29:39.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我打不开！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.13,1:29:42.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}威廉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.17,1:29:43.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊莉莎白\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Elizabeth!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.34,1:29:44.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}威廉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.52,1:29:57.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢了 克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why, thank you, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.77,1:29:59.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不客气\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.48,1:30:02.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是谢你 这猴子也叫克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not you. We named the monkey Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.23,1:30:06.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各位 咱们又有希望了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gents! Our hope is restored!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.23,1:30:07.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.19,1:30:46.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们敢出 谈判 这两个字\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Any of you so much as thinks the word parley,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.27,1:30:49.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就把你们开膛剖肚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll have your guts for garters!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.91,1:30:58.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}威尔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.37,1:31:00.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们这些臭海盗！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop it! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.25,1:31:03.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎回来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome back, miss.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.29,1:31:06.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们上次款待过你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You took advantage of our hospitality last time.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.09,1:31:09.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这次你要好好回报我们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It holds fair now that you return the favor!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.39,1:31:16.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}姓巴的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Barbossa!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.43,1:31:19.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}威尔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.23,1:31:23.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把她放走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She goes free!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.35,1:31:26.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在想什呀？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's in your head, boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.44,1:31:28.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}镶她走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She goes free.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.40,1:31:32.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只有一发子弹 我又不会死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've only got one shot, and we can't die.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.53,1:31:34.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别干蠢事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't do anything stupid!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.49,1:31:38.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是不会死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.83,1:31:40.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.96,1:31:43.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这种蠢事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.62,1:31:45.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.96,1:31:47.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也不是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No one! He's no one!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.21,1:31:51.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是我阿姨外甥的远亲\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A distant cousin of my aunt's nephew, twice removed.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.46,1:31:53.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}歌声很 是个太监\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lovely singing voice, though. Eunuch!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.80,1:31:55.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我叫威尔杜纳\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My name is Will Turner!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.55,1:31:58.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我父亲是鞋带比尔杜纳\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My father was Bootstrap Bill Turner.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.30,1:32:00.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我身上流著他的血\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His blood runs in my veins.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.97,1:32:05.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他跟比尔长得一模一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's the spitting image of ol' Bootstrap Bill, come back to haunt us!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.23,1:32:07.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}照我的话做\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On my word, do as I say,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.27,1:32:09.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}否则我就扣下扳机\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or I'll pull this trigger,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.23,1:32:11.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}沉入大海\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and be lost to Davy Jones' locker!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.48,1:32:14.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说出你的条件\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Name your terms, Mr. Turner.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.82,1:32:15.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把伊莉莎白放走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Elizabeth goes free!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.07,1:32:17.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道啦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, we know that one.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.78,1:32:18.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.45,1:32:22.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把船员也放走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the crew!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.79,1:32:24.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不准伤害他们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The crew are not to be harmed!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.50,1:32:31.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一言为定\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.48,1:32:52.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}姓巴的 你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Barbossa, you lying bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.23,1:32:54.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你发誓要放她走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You swore she'd go free!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.90,1:32:57.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别证赖我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't dare impugn me honor, boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.24,1:32:58.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我答应放她走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I agreed she'd go free.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.99,1:33:02.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是你没何时何地\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was you who failed to specify when or where.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.71,1:33:11.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真不想失去这美的束西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Though it does seem a shame to lose something so fine, don't it, lads?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.71,1:33:12.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Aye.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.71,1:33:16.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我要你把洋装还给我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So I'll be havin' that dress back before you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.22,1:33:22.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一向都喜欢你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I always liked you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.35,1:33:28.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这跟你的黑心很搭配\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goes with your black heart!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.27,1:33:31.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还很温暖\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's still warm.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.82,1:33:36.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Off you go!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.94,1:33:38.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快去呀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.91,1:33:43.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你拖太久了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Too long!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.21,1:33:56.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们不必这对我吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I really rather hoped we were past all this.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.30,1:34:00.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack. Jack!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.60,1:34:04.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没注意到？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did ya not notice?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.14,1:34:08.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是上回你当家的小岛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That be the same island we made you governor of on our last little trip.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.69,1:34:11.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我注意到了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I did notice.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.40,1:34:15.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许这次你也能逃离生天\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Perhaps you'll be able to conjure up another miraculous escape,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.61,1:34:17.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过我看不太可能\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.07,1:34:21.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Off you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.62,1:34:25.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上回你给我一发子弹\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Last time you left me a pistol with one shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.33,1:34:26.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的对\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By the powers, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.00,1:34:29.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把克的手枪拿来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where be Jack's pistol?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.20,1:34:30.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把它给我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bring it forward.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.54,1:34:36.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这次有雨个人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seeing as there's two of us, a gentleman...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.05,1:34:38.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你应该给我们雨把手枪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...would give us a pair of pistols.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.92,1:34:40.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只给你一把\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It'll be one pistol, as before,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.72,1:34:43.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就当个绅士把她给了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you can be the gentleman and shoot the lady,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.60,1:34:45.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}镶自 己活活死吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and starve to death yourself!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.79,1:35:13.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我第二次 眼睁睁看他走我的船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the second time I've had to watch that man sail away with my ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.79,1:35:18.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你上次这儿逃走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You were marooned on this island before, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.55,1:35:20.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这次一样也可以\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We can escape the same way!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.17,1:35:22.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有什用呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To what point and purpose, young missy?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.05,1:35:24.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鬼盗船不见了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Black Pearl is gone,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.84,1:35:28.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非你身上藏著一艘……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and unless you have a rudder and a lot of sails hidden in that bodice...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.39,1:35:30.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看是没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unlikely...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.85,1:35:33.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等你到杜先生早就了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Young Mr. Turner will be dead long before you can reach him.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.48,1:35:38.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是史克船长耶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But you're Captain Jack Sparrow!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.86,1:35:43.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你被团团 包围 还不是轻易逃走了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You vanished from under the eyes of seven agents of the East India Company!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.32,1:35:46.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不开一枪就攻下拿梭城了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You sacked Nassau Port without even firing a shot!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.16,1:35:48.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底是不是傅奇海盗呀？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you the pirate I've read about or not?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.95,1:35:52.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上次你是怎逃走的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How did you escape last time?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.30,1:36:01.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上次……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Last time...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.21,1:36:04.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只待了三天\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I was here a grand total of three days, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.01,1:36:06.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上次……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Last time...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.05,1:36:11.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}私酒贩把这座小岛当食库\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...the rum runners used this island as a cache.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.39,1:36:13.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我服他们载我一程\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They came by and I was able to barter passage off.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.94,1:36:15.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看来……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}From the looks of things,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.77,1:36:17.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们早就被逮捕了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}they've long been out of business.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.02,1:36:23.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看这全都是 你朋友倪准将的功\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You probably have your bloody friend Norrington to thank for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.19,1:36:24.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So that's it then?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.03,1:36:29.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是史克船长的傅奇故事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the secret, grand adventure of the infamous Jack Sparrow!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.87,1:36:32.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那三天\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You spent three days,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.70,1:36:35.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只躺在沙上灌酒 ？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}lying on a beach, drinking rum.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.42,1:36:41.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎光临加勒比海\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome to the Caribbean, love.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.26,1:36:52.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们是害群之马 大壤蛋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're devils, we're black sheep We're really bad eggs
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.56,1:36:54.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大块吃肉 大口喝酒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Drink up, me hearties Yo ho
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.81,1:36:59.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海盗生涯乐逍\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yo ho, yo ho A pirate's life for me
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.40,1:37:01.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我超爱这首歌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love this song!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.24,1:37:06.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真正的大壤蛋 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really bad eggs!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.28,1:37:13.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等我把鬼盗船回来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When I get the Pear! back,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.37,1:37:15.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一定要教会船员\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna teach it to the whole crew,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.91,1:37:17.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一起唱这首歌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and we'll sing it all the time!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.54,1:37:21.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会是西班牙最有名的海盗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you will be positively the most fearsome pirates in the Spanish Main!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.42,1:37:23.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不只是西班牙\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not just the Spanish Main, love.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.30,1:37:26.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是整片大海\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The entire ocean!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.09,1:37:27.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}整个世界\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The entire world!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.92,1:37:30.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咱们想去哪儿就去哪儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wherever we want to go, we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.80,1:37:32.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船就该如此\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's what a ship is, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.43,1:37:35.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不止是龙骨 船身 甲板 风帆\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not just a keel and a hull and a deck and sails.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.35,1:37:36.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些只是船的一部份\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's what a ship needs.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.93,1:37:38.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一艘船……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But what a ship is...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.31,1:37:43.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鬼盗船代表的是·.\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the Black Pearl really is...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.73,1:37:47.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}自 由\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...1S freedom.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.99,1:37:50.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}克……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.11,1:37:54.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一个人被困在岛上一定很问\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It must be really terrible for you to be trapped on this island.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.66,1:37:56.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.95,1:38:02.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}幸好这次我多了一个伴儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But the company is... ... Infinitely better than last time, and the...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.42,1:38:08.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且风景也比上次美 史派先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-...scenery has definitely improved.   -Mr. Sparrow!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.17,1:38:12.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还没醉 别跟我疯言疯语\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not entirely sure I've had enough rum to allow that kind of talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.85,1:38:15.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我懂你的意思\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I Know exactly what you mean, love.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.15,1:38:24.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}敬自 由\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To freedom!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.44,1:38:28.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}敬鬼盗船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To the Black Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.52,1:38:59.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}完了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.68,1:39:02.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}住手 住手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not good! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.52,1:39:03.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not good!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.81,1:39:04.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在干什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.86,1:39:06.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你烧掉了所有食物 勿、树叶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've burned all the food, the shade...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.02,1:39:09.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有兰姆酒 对 兰姆酒没了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-...the rum!   -Yes, the rum is gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.36,1:39:10.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why is the rum gone?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.07,1:39:12.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第一 酒是穿肠毒药\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One, because it is a vile drink
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.03,1:39:15.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它会把正人君子变成卑鄙小人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that turns even the most respectable men into scoundrels.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.03,1:39:19.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第二 这股狼烟有一千吹高\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Two, that signal is over 1,000 feet high.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.20,1:39:21.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}整个皇家海军都在找我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The entire Royal Navy is out looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.50,1:39:25.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样一来他们不可能看不到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you think there is even the slightest chance they won't see it?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.17,1:39:27.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你为什要烧掉兰姆酒 ？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But why is the rum gone?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.09,1:39:29.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你等著瞧吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just wait, Captain Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.59,1:39:31.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再过一 两个小时\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You give it one hour, maybe two,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.47,1:39:36.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就会看到白帆出现在眼前\N{\rEN\blur0.8}keep a weather eye open, and you will see white sails on that horizon.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.89,1:39:44.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什我一个人一定很问 真是假悍悍\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Must've been terrible for you to be trapped here, Jack."
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.94,1:39:48.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这下我可大了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Must've been terrible for you..." Well, it bloody is now!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.41,1:39:58.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}以后她会变得无法无天了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There'll be no living with her after this.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.83,1:40:00.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得去救威尔 不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-But we've got to save WII!   -No!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.79,1:40:02.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你现在安全了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.33,1:40:04.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要马上回家\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We will return to Port Royal immediately,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.50,1:40:06.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不能去追海盗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}not go gallivanting after pirates!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.54,1:40:08.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那他就必死无疑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then we condemn him to death!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.54,1:40:12.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那很令人遗憾\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The boy's fate is regrettable...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.34,1:40:14.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过叫他要去当海盗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but then, so was his decision to engage in piracy.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.01,1:40:18.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是为了救我呀 不我出事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To rescue me! To prevent anything from happening to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.35,1:40:22.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请容我提供专业意见\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I may be so bold as to interject my professional opinion,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.27,1:40:25.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鬼盗船已经被打到歪一\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the Pear! was listing near to scuppers after the battle.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.48,1:40:28.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}速度一定很慢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's very unlikely she'd be able to make good time.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.44,1:40:29.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想想看\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.86,1:40:32.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鬼盗船耶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Black Pear.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.11,1:40:35.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它是硕果仅存的海盗船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The last real pirate threat in the Caribbean, mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.66,1:40:38.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎能放过它？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How can you pass that up?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.78,1:40:43.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我必须为大局著想\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By remembering that I serve others, Mr. Sparrow,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.66,1:40:46.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而不是我自 己 我求求你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-not only myself.   -Commodore, I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.25,1:40:47.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为了我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please do this!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.29,1:40:48.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For me!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.96,1:40:51.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}算是送我的结婚礼物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As a wedding gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.21,1:40:52.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊莉莎白 ？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Elizabeth?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.46,1:40:56.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你答应准将的求婚了 ？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you accepting the commodore's proposal?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.43,1:40:59.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.30,1:41:01.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我超爱婚礼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A wedding! I love weddings!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.06,1:41:03.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有喝不完的酒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Drinks all around!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.10,1:41:08.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道 ，把我起来，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know. "Clap him in irons," right?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.40,1:41:16.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要你跟他们一起去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Sparrow... ... you will accompany these fine men to the helm
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.20,1:41:18.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把方位告他们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and provide us with a bearing to Isla de Muerta.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.86,1:41:22.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后我要你好好体会一句成语\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll then spend the rest of the voyage contemplating all possible meanings
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.83,1:41:25.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}沉默是金」\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of the phrase "silent as the grave."
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.37,1:41:26.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你明不明白 ？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do I make myself clear?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.00,1:41:29.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白得很\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Inescapably clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.88,1:41:35.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乖乖隆个咚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shiver me timbers!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.13,1:41:37.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老卡你漏掉一块地板\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cotton says you missed a bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.76,1:41:44.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你识威廉杜纳？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You knew William Turner?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.02,1:41:48.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鞋带比雨\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Old Bootstrap Bill.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.18,1:41:49.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}识呀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We knew him.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.19,1:41:54.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不同意我们那对史克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Never sat well with Bootstrap, what we did to Jack Sparrow,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.23,1:41:56.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}发动叛变那件事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the mutiny and all.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.90,1:41:58.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他这不符合誓约\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He said it wasn't right with the code.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.99,1:42:03.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以他才把金留给你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's why he sent off a piece of the treasure to you, as it were.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.20,1:42:06.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他我们应该被咒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He said we deserved to be cursed...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.41,1:42:10.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}永远受到咒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and remain cursed.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.54,1:42:11.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大猪头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stupid blighter!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.67,1:42:13.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是个好人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good man.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.54,1:42:15.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也可以想像\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But, as you can imagine,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.38,1:42:18.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船长对他很不爽\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that didn't sit too well with the captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.88,1:42:22.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船长对他超不爽的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That didn't sit too well with the captain at all!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.22,1:42:25.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟他巴船长做了什 是我在故事耶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Tell him what Barbossa did.   -I'm telling the story!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.39,1:42:32.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船长做了什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So... what the captain did...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.56,1:42:35.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他把弹绑在比尔的鞋带\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... he strapped a cannon to Bootstrap's bootstraps.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.23,1:42:36.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}绑在他的鞋带上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bootstrap's bootstraps!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.78,1:42:39.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们就眼睁睁看著 老比尔杜纳\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Last we saw of ol' Bill Turner...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.86,1:42:45.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}沉入黑暗的大海 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...he was sinking to the crushin' black oblivion of Davy Jones' locker!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.95,1:42:50.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}后来才发现他的血 能解除魔咒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Course it was only after that we learned we needed his blood to lift the curse.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.37,1:42:53.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这才口叫刺\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's what you'd call ironic.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.59,1:42:59.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把他带来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bring him!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.43,1:43:08.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不管局势如何\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't care for the situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.97,1:43:12.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们衡进去可能会中埋伏\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Any attempt to stall in the caves could turn into an ambush.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.10,1:43:15.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这次埋伏的人是你们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not if you're the one doing the ambushing.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.52,1:43:19.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我进去叫他们划小船出来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I go in and convince Barbossa to send his men out in their little boats.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.28,1:43:22.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们就回无畏号去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You and your men return to the Dauntless
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.15,1:43:25.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用大把他们回姥姥家\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and blast the bejesus out of them with your little cannons.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.45,1:43:26.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这对你有何损失？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you have to lose?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.78,1:43:30.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什损失也没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing I'd lament being rid of.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.96,1:43:33.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过我要老实\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, to be quite honest with you,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.92,1:43:36.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}无畏号上的人会有危险\N{\rEN\blur0.8}there's still a slight risk to those aboard the Dauntless,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.96,1:43:40.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}包括未来的准将夫人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}which includes the future Mrs. Commodore.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.80,1:43:43.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是为了你的安全 我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It's for your safety!   -Don't care what the Commodore ordered!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.97,1:43:44.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要告他 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have to tell him!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.01,1:43:48.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海盗受到咒 他们死不了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The pirates! They're cursed! They can't be killed!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.10,1:43:50.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他早就知道了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry, miss. He's already informed of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.68,1:43:54.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是小美人鱼告他的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A little mermaid flopped up on deck and told him the whole story!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.48,1:43:56.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是史克的计\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is Jack Sparrow's doing!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.03,1:44:09.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别害怕\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No reason to fret.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.58,1:44:12.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要刺一针 流滴血……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just a prick of the finger, a few drops of blood...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.20,1:44:14.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这次不能冒险\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No mistakes this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.29,1:44:16.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他只有一半血统\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's only half Turner.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.08,1:44:17.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杀了他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We spill it all!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.92,1:44:21.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这下他应该害怕了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Guess there is reason to fret.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.69,1:44:37.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}借过一下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Beg your pardon, mate. Beg your pardon.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.94,1:44:39.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}血债血还\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Begun by blood...   -Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.77,1:44:42.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}魔咒……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By blood un...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.86,1:44:45.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.91,1:44:47.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不可能\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not possible!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.03,1:44:50.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是不可能\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not probable.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.24,1:44:52.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊莉莎白呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's Elizabeth?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.41,1:44:55.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我过 她很安全\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's safe, just like I promised.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.71,1:44:58.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她过 她要嫁给倪准将\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's all set to marry Norrington, just like she promised,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.71,1:45:01.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也过 你要为她死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you get to die for her, just like you promised.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.17,1:45:03.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们都是话算话的男人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So we're all men of our word, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.38,1:45:06.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除了伊莉莎白是女人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Except for Elizabeth, who is, in fact, a woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.72,1:45:08.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}闲嘴 待会轮到你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shut up! You're next!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.72,1:45:14.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你最好别杀他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't want to be doing that, mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.60,1:45:16.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 我很想杀他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I really think I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.35,1:45:20.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这是自寻死路\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your funeral.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.40,1:45:25.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我为什不能杀他？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And why don't I want to be doing it?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.44,1:45:27.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, because...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.11,1:45:32.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为皇家海军的旗无畏号\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because the HMS Dauntless, the pride of the Royal Navy,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.04,1:45:36.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}正在海上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is floating just off shore,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.37,1:45:38.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等著你们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.26,1:45:47.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们在这儿干嘛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What we doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.34,1:45:52.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海盗想不到 我们会埋伏在这儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The pirates come out, unprepared and unawares.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.80,1:45:54.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们全力攻撃\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We catch 'em in a crossfire,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.93,1:45:57.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把他们打得落花流水\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and send 'em down to see Old Hob.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.06,1:46:01.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道我们在这儿干嘛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I Know why we're here. I meant...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.52,1:46:05.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是为啥不史克的话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...why aren't we doing what it was... What Mr. Sparrow said we should do?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.32,1:46:06.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用大把他们掉？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With the cannons and all?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.90,1:46:09.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我不相信他的话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because it was Mr. Sparrow who said it.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.58,1:46:15.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是他不老实？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think he wasn't telling the truth?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.24,1:46:17.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just hear me out, mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.20,1:46:20.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你派手下偷偷登上无畏号 雨三下就把船员解决掉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your order your men to row out to the Dauntless, they do what they do best...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.04,1:46:26.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样一来你就有雨艘船了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Robert's your uncle, Fanny's your aunt. There you are with two ships.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.55,1:46:28.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大可以成立自 己的隧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The makings of your very own fleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.05,1:46:32.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你当然指最大的那艘旗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Course, you'll take the grandest as your flagship, and who's to argue?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.72,1:46:34.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是鬼盗船呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But what of the Pearl?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.76,1:46:37.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}镶我当船长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Name me captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.14,1:46:40.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我到的财宝分给你一成\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll sail under your colors, I'll give you ten percent of me plunder,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.64,1:46:42.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也可以自封为……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you'll get to introduce yourself as...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.44,1:46:46.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……巴准将\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Commodore Barbossa.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.36,1:46:47.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瞭？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Savvy?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.48,1:46:49.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的交换条件\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I suppose, in exchange, you'll be
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.78,1:46:52.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是他一命？ 不是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-wanting me not to kill the whelp.   -No. Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.66,1:46:54.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}管杀了他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By all means, kill the whelp!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.37,1:46:56.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过时机还没到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.83,1:46:59.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等到时机成熟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait to lift the curse
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.04,1:47:01.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再解除魔咒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}until the opportune moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.17,1:47:06.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也就是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For instance...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.67,1:47:11.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等你杀了倪准将的手下以后\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... after you've killed Norrington's men.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.01,1:47:13.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.68,1:47:15.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把他们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...last...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.39,1:47:16.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杀掉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}. One.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.48,1:47:28.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到我名字\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've been planning this from the beginning!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.86,1:47:30.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就开始计划了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ever since you learned my name!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.28,1:47:32.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.62,1:47:36.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要分五成\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want 50 percent of your plunder.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.82,1:47:37.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一成五 四成\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-15!   -40!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.87,1:47:38.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}两成五\N{\rEN\blur0.8}25!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.04,1:47:41.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我附送你一顶帽子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I'll buy you the hat.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.41,1:47:43.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一顶大帽子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A really big one.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.21,1:47:45.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准将\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Commodore.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.50,1:47:49.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一言为定\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have an accord.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.38,1:47:53.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大儿登上小艇\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All hands to the boats!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.68,1:47:55.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}歹势\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Apologies.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.89,1:47:57.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你来发号施令\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You give the orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.89,1:47:59.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各位\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gents...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.89,1:48:02.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...take a walk!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.11,1:48:08.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们不坐船？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not to the boats?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.83,1:49:10.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先别开枪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.80,1:49:15.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就像希人攻打特洛伊城\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is just like what the Greeks done at Troy!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.97,1:49:18.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只不过他们是马\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cept they was in a horse,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.64,1:49:20.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是穿女装\N{\rEN\blur0.8}instead of dresses.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.80,1:49:22.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是木马啦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wooden horse.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.15,1:49:36.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一下子就好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A moment, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.32,1:49:41.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊莉莎白 ？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Elizabeth?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.58,1:49:46.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只想告你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just want you to know, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.50,1:49:49.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你今天做了正确的决定\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I believe you made a very good decision today.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.79,1:49:52.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以你为荣\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Couldn't be more proud of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.30,1:49:57.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但为了错理由做的正确决定\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But, you know, even a good decision, if made for the wrong reasons,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.51,1:49:59.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也可能是错的决定\N{\rEN\blur0.8}can be a wrong decision.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.02,1:50:09.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上尉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.20,1:50:29.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊莉莎白 ？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Elizabeth?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.54,1:50:32.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.04,1:50:37.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有没有在？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Elizabeth, are you even listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.78,1:51:06.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你做了什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.83,1:51:10.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别这样 这样很耶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop that! I already feel like a fool!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.54,1:51:12.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看起来很美呀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look nice, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.42,1:51:19.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你敢我很美？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do I look nice now?!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.79,1:51:57.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老实\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I must admit, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.13,1:51:59.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为我看透你了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought I had you figured.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.13,1:52:02.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没想到你还真人摸不透\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But it turns out you're a hard man to predict.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.38,1:52:04.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我这人最不老实了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Me, I'm dishonest.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.43,1:52:07.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不老实的人当然会使\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And a dishonest man you can always trust to be dishonest.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.30,1:52:08.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是一定的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.64,1:52:11.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要当心的是老实人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... It's the honest ones you want to watch out for.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.31,1:52:13.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你永远猜不到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause you can never predict
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.64,1:52:16.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他时会做出……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}when they're going to do something incredibly...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.98,1:52:17.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蠢事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.31,1:52:53.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这可不是普通的地方\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're off the edge of the map, mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.43,1:52:55.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里有可怕的怪物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here, there be monsters!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.36,1:53:01.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.36,1:53:05.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想先吃什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What would you pick to eat first?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.53,1:53:07.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们应该先想好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think we should decide now,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.53,1:53:09.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}魔咒一解除就不必浪费时间\N{\rEN\blur0.8}just so we're ready when the time comes!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.77,1:53:35.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什声音？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.83,1:53:59.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大小姐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's Elizabeth!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.44,1:54:22.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快回船上 快点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Make for the ship! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.70,1:55:17.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你打不赢我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't beat me, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.85,1:55:43.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这下可有趣了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's interesting!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.16,1:55:56.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我忍不住偷了一枚金\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I couldn't resist, mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.43,1:57:03.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}歹势\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.73,1:57:14.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在怎样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, what now, Jack Sparrow?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.44,1:57:17.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咱们雨个活死人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are we to be two immortals, locked in an empty battle
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.28,1:57:19.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要打到世界末日来临？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}until Judgment Day, when the trumpets sound?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.66,1:57:22.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也可以投降\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or you could surrender.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.40,1:57:50.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家一起来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All of you with me!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.65,1:57:52.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}威尔在岛上 我们去救他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will is in that cave, and we must save him!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.82,1:57:55.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}预备·用力 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ready, and... heave!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.99,1:58:04.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要你们忙\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please, I need your help! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.00,1:58:06.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}见好就收\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Any port in a storm.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.91,1:58:09.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老卡的对’手 我们有鬼盗船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cotton's right. We've got the Pear!!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.08,1:58:11.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们要丢下克？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What about Jack? Are you just gonna leave him?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.42,1:58:13.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他欠我们一艘船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack owes us a ship!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:13.30,1:58:14.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们也要遵守誓约\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's the code to consider.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.42,1:58:16.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}誓约？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The code?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.30,1:58:22.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们是海盗呀 管什誓约？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're pirates! Hang the code and hang the rules!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.55,1:58:24.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}反正誓约只是拿来做参考\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're more like guidelines, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:28.77,1:58:30.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}臭海盗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bloody pirates!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.36,1:58:44.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它开走了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is it supposed to be doing that?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.62,1:58:46.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们偷走我们的船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're stealing our ship!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:47.29,1:58:48.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}臭海盗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bloody pirates!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.04,1:58:52.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快上船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Boarders away!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.09,1:59:03.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上呀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.00,1:59:30.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的眼球\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Me eye!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:50.27,1:59:52.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要你苦头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna teach you the meaning of pain!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.44,1:59:54.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想苦头？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You like pain?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.81,1:59:57.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去穿束腹就知道了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Try wearing a corset.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:07.58,2:00:09.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}克站在哪一？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whose side is Jack on?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.28,2:00:12.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You mean at the moment?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.28,2:00:48.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不公平\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No fair!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.43,2:01:16.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你白白浪费 留 了十年的子弹\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ten years you carry that pistol, and now you waste your shot!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:17.69,2:01:20.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他没有浪费\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He didn't waste it.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.30,2:01:46.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我感觉……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I feel...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:51.39,2:01:52.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……好冰冷\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...cold.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.95,2:02:57.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谈判 ？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Parley?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.45,2:02:59.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们把船回来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The ship is ours, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.41,2:03:01.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Huzzah! Huzzah!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:10.59,2:03:11.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Huzzah!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:47.67,2:03:50.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们应该回无畏号了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We should return to the Dauntless.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:52.55,2:03:56.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的未婚夫会心你的安危\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your fiancé will be wanting to know you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:05.86,2:04:09.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你在等待时机成熟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you were waiting for the opportune moment...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:10.15,2:04:11.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是刷才\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... that was it.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.95,2:04:18.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请你送我回我的船吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now if you'd be so kind, I'd be much obliged if you'd drop me off at my ship.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:22.62,2:04:24.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很遗憾 克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:26.71,2:04:28.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们那做是应该的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They done what's right by them.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:29.00,2:04:30.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不怪他们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can't expect more than that.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:46.35,2:04:47.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}史克……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jack Sparrow!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:47.73,2:04:51.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是史克船长啦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We have learned that you...   -Captain! Captain Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:52.53,2:04:55.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}.你被判犯下滔天大罪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...for your willful commission of crimes against the crown.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.86,2:05:01.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的罪名不计其数\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Said crimes being numerous in quantity, and sinister in nature.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:01.87,2:05:05.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}以下是最令人发指的罪名\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The most egregious of these to be cited herewith:
Dialogue: 0,2:05:05.71,2:05:09.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海盗 走私…… 这是不对的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Piracy, smuggling...   -This is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:10.46,2:05:13.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}倪准将必须依法行事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Commodore Norrington is bound by the law,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:13.55,2:05:16.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们都一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as are we all.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:16.13,2:05:18.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}假扮西班牙海军军官\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... Impersonating an officer of the Spanish Royal Navy,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:18.93,2:05:22.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}假扮英国教会神父\N{\rEN\blur0.8}impersonating a cleric of the Church of England...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:22.10,2:05:23.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.27,2:05:25.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}以假旗航海\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sailing under false colors,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:25.35,2:05:29.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}火、绑票 劫\N{\rEN\blur0.8}arson, kidnapping, looting, poaching,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:29.60,2:05:35.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走私 烧杀掳掠 堕落腐败\N{\rEN\blur0.8}brigandage, pilfering, depravity, depredation,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:35.61,2:05:37.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}藐视王法\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and general lawlessness.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.82,2:05:40.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的罪孽深重\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And for these crimes,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:40.58,2:05:46.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}被判在今天接受绞刑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you have been sentenced to be, on this day, hung by the neck, until dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:46.96,2:05:49.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上帝惘你的灵魂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}May God have mercy on your soul.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.29,2:05:50.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}史总督\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Governor Swann.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.92,2:05:52.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准将\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Commodore.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:54.34,2:05:55.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊莉莎白\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:56.80,2:05:59.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我见到你之后 每天都应该跟你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I should've told you every day, from the moment I met you.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:02.97,2:06:03.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爱你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:18.53,2:06:20.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Boy, watch yourself!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.32,2:06:21.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来人呀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Marines!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:21.49,2:06:23.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能呼吸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:24.95,2:06:25.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Elizabeth!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:28.96,2:06:30.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Move!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.88,2:06:43.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You men! With me!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:17.09,2:07:18.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, men!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:43.70,2:07:47.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我早就料到 你会来逃亡这一招\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought we might have to endure some manner of ill-conceived escape attempt.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.54,2:07:50.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是我没想到你也会造反\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But not from you.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.20,2:07:54.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一回来就给你特救\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On our return to Port Royal, I granted you clemency.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:54.08,2:07:55.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一点都不感激\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And this is how you thank me?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.79,2:07:57.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}反而跟他同流合污\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By throwing in your lot with him?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.92,2:07:59.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是个海盗呀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:59.59,2:08:01.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也是个好人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And a good man.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:02.34,2:08:06.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我要跟他一起被吊死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If all I've achieved here is that the hangman will own two pairs of boots instead of one,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:06.85,2:08:08.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so be it.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:08.56,2:08:10.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少我对得起自 己的良心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At least my conscience will be clear.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:10.47,2:08:13.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你别自不量力\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You forget your place, Turner.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:14.98,2:08:18.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能你抓走克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's right here, between you and Jack.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:22.11,2:08:23.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也不能\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As is mine.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:23.86,2:08:25.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊莉莎白\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Elizabeth!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:26.70,2:08:27.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把枪放下来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lower your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.66,2:08:30.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快放下来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For goodness sake, put them down!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:35.75,2:08:38.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是真心爱他？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So this is where your heart truly lies, then.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:40.30,2:08:41.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:50.31,2:08:54.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这真是令人感动\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well! I'm actually feeling rather good about this.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.27,2:08:56.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咱们好像是一个大家庭\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think we've all arrived at a very special place.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:56.81,2:08:57.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}兄友弟恭\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Spiritually.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:57.98,2:08:59.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}父慈子孝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ecumenically.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.07,2:09:01.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和乐融融\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Grammatically.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:02.74,2:09:05.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实我是支持你的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want you to know that I was rooting for you, mate.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:06.61,2:09:07.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我挺你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Know that.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:11.62,2:09:13.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊莉莎白\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:15.08,2:09:17.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咱们俩是不会有结果的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It would never have worked between us, darling.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:19.13,2:09:21.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很抱歉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.13,2:09:24.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}威尔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:26.42,2:09:28.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好帅的帽子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice hat.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:30.05,2:09:31.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Friends!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:33.56,2:09:39.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天你们将永远记得.·\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This the day that you will always remember as the day that...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:43.98,2:09:46.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个猪头 他插翅也难逃\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Idiot! He's nowhere to go but back to the noose!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:49.07,2:09:50.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海盗船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sail ho!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:58.46,2:10:01.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你打算怎辨？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's your plan of action?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:01.84,2:10:02.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}长官？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:07.22,2:10:09.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许有时\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Perhaps on the rare occasion
Dialogue: 0,2:10:09.72,2:10:13.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为了伸张正义 而去当海盗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}pursuing the right course demands an act of piracy,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:13.68,2:10:17.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海盗也可以是好人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}piracy itself can be the right course?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:21.73,2:10:23.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杜先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Turner!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:29.11,2:10:31.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我意为我的行为承后果\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will accept the consequences of my actions.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:37.91,2:10:39.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这把剑打造得很完美\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is a beautiful sword.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:42.00,2:10:43.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我希望你无做什\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I would expect the man who made it
Dialogue: 0,2:10:43.79,2:10:48.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都像剑一样 全心全意地投入\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to show the same care and devotion in every aspect of his life.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:50.63,2:10:52.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:55.26,2:10:56.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准将\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Commodore!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:56.39,2:10:58.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}史克呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What about Sparrow?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:00.02,2:11:02.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们他先走一天也无妨\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I think we can afford to give him one day's head start.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:12.20,2:11:15.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是你选选的男人 是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is the path you've chosen, is it?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:16.66,2:11:18.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After all...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:19.00,2:11:20.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他只是个铁匠\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...he is a blacksmith.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:21.54,2:11:22.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.50,2:11:29.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是个海盗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:53.99,2:11:55.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Bring him in!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:06.04,2:12:08.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为你们会遵守海盗誓约\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thought you were supposed to keep to the code.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:08.67,2:12:13.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那只不过是用来做参考的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We figured they were more actual... ... guidelines.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:17.51,2:12:19.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:20.35,2:12:21.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}史船长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Captain Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:26.02,2:12:27.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鬼盗船是你的了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Black Pearl is yours!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:43.41,2:12:45.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大儿集合\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On deck, you scabrous dogs!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:45.17,2:12:46.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拉起索\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hands to braces!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:46.71,2:12:48.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}扬帆启航\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let go and haul to run free.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:50.63,2:12:52.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now...
Dialogue: 0,2:12:52.51,2:12:54.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要航向天际\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bring me that horizon.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:01.64,2:13:03.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是大壤蛋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And really bad eggs
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.06,2:13:09.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大块吃肉 大口喝酒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Drink up, me hearties Yo ho
Dialogue: 0,2:14:23.93,2:14:28.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}片名 神鬼奇航 鬼盗船魔咒
